<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Orthodox Yiddish TaNaCH 2023</book>
  <para style="h">Iyov</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iyov</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iyov</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iyov</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" pubnumber="א" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />es iz geven a man in land Uts vos zain nomen iz geven Iyov; un der doziker man iz geven erlech un rechtfartik, un a yore Elokim, un opgekert fun shlechts. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />un es zainen geborn gevorn bai im zibn zin un drai techter. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />un zain eigens iz geven zibn toiznt shof, un drai toiznt kemlen, un finf hundert geshpan rinder, un finf hundert eizelins, un zeyer a sach knecht; un der doziker man iz geven greser fun ale kinder fun mizrech.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />un zaine zin flegn gein un machn a moltsait bai itlechn in hoiz in zain tog, un zei flegn shikn un rufn zeyere drai shvester, tsu esen un tsu trinken mit zei. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />un es iz geven, az vi di teg fun dem moltsait hobn zich arumgedreit, azoi hot Iyov geshikt un hot zei geheilikt, un er flegt zich federn in der peire, un oifbrengen brandopfer loit der tsol fun zei alemen, vorem Iyov hot gezogt: efsher hobn maine kinder gezindikt, un zei hobn gelestert Elokim in zeyer hartsn. azoi flegt Iyov ton ale mol.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />un es iz geven der tog, ven di zin fun Elokim zainen gekumen zich shteln far Hashem, un oich der stn iz gekumen tsvishn zei. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />hot Hashem gezogt tsum stn: fun vanen kumstu? hot der stn geentfert Hashem, un hot gezogt: fun vandern iber der erd un fun arumgein oif ir. <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />hot Hashem gezogt tsum stn: hostu acht geton oif main knecht Iyovn, az es iz nishto aza vi er oif der erd, a man erlech un rechtfartik, yore Elokim un opgekert fun shlechts? <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />hot der stn geentfert Hashem, un hot gezogt: iz den umzist Iyov a yore Elokim? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />hostu nisht arumgetsamt im un zain hoizgezint un alts vos iz zains rund arum? di arbet fun zaine hent hostu gebentsht, un zain eigens iz farshpreit ibern land. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />ober shtrek akorsht ois dain hant, un rir on epes vos iz zains, oib er vet nisht in dain ponem dich lestern. <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />hot Hashem gezogt tsum stn: ot iz alts vos iz zains in dain hant, nor oif im zolstu nisht oisshtrekn dain hant.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">iz der stn aroisgegangen fun far Hashem.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />un es iz geven ein tog, vi zaine zin un zaine techter esen un trinken vain in hoiz fun zeyer eltstn bruder, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />azoi iz a sheliech gekumen tsu Iyovn, un hot gezogt: di rinder hobn geakert, un di eizelins hobn zich gefitert lebn zei, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />zainen bafaln shvoer, un hobn zei tsugenumen, un di yungen hobn zei dershlogn mitn sharf fun shverd un nor ich alein bin antrunen gevorn dir ontsuzogn. <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />vi der redt noch, azoi iz ongekumen an anderer, un hot gezogt: a faier fun Elokim iz aropgefaln fun himel, un hot ongetsundn di shof un di yungen, un hot zei fartsert, un nor ich alein bin antrunen gevorn dir ontsuzogn. <verse eid="JOB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />vi der redt noch, azoi iz ongekumen an anderer, un hot gezogt: Kasdim hobn gemacht drai machnus, un zainen ongefaln oif di kemlen, un hobn zei tsugenumen, un di yungen hobn zei dershlogn mitn sharf fun shverd, un nor ich alein bin antrunen gevorn dir ontsuzogn. <verse eid="JOB 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />vi der redt noch, azoi iz ongekumen an anderer, un hot gezogt: daine zin un daine techter hobn gegesn un getrunken vain in hoiz fun zeyer eltstn bruder, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />ersht a groiser vint iz ongekumen fun der zait fun midber, un hot ongechapt di fir vinklen fun hoiz, un es iz aingefaln oif di yungelait, un zei zainen geshtorbn, un nor ich alein bin antrunen gevorn dir ontsuzogn.<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />iz Iyov oifgeshtanen, un hot tserisn zain mantl, un hot opgeshorn zain kop, un iz gefaln oif der erd, un hot zich gebukt. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />un er hot gezogt: naket bin ich aroisgegangen fun main muters laib, un naket vel ich zich umkeren ahin; Hashem hot gegebn, un Hashem hot tsugenumen, geloibt zol zain der nomen fun Hashem.<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />bai alem dem hot Iyov nisht gezindikt, un nisht gegebn kein lesterung tsu Elokim.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" pubnumber="ב" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />un es iz geven der tog ven di zin fun Elokim zainen gekumen zich shteln far Hashem, un oich der stn iz gekumen tsvishn zei, zich tsu shteln far Hashem. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />hot Hashem gezogt tsum stn: fun vanen kumstu? hot der stn geentfert Hashem, un hot gezogt: fun vandern iber der erd un fun arumgein oif ir. <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />hot Hashem gezogt tsum stn: hostu acht geton oif main knecht Iyovn, az es iz nishto aza vi er oif der erd, a man erlech un rechtfartik, yore Elokim, un opgekert fun shlechts? un er halt zich noch alts bai zain frumkeit; un du host mich ongeredt oif im, im umtsubrengen umzist. <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />hot der stn geentfert Hashem, un hot gezogt: hoit far hoit, un alts vos a mentsh hot, vet er avekgebn far zain nefesh. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />ober shtrek akorsht ois dain hant, un rir on zain bein un zain fleish, oib er vet nisht in dain ponem dich lestern. <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />hot Hashem gezogt tsum stn: ot iz er in dain hant, nor zain nefesh hit.<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />iz der stn aroisgegangen fun far Hashem, un er hot geplogt Iyovn mit a beizn oisshlog fun zain fustrit biz zain sharbn. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />hot er zich genumen a sherbl zich tsu kratsn dermit; un er iz gezesn in ash. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />hot zain vaib tsu im gezogt: haltst zich noch alts bai dain frumkeit? lester Elokim, un shtarb. <verse eid="JOB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />hot er tsu ir gezogt: azoi vi es redt eine fun di nidertrechtike redstu. zoln mir dos gute yo onnemen fun Elokim, un dos shlechte zoln mir nisht onnemen? bai alem dem hot Iyov nisht gezindikt mit zaine lipn.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />un Iyovs drai gute fraint hobn gehert fun al dem dozikn beiz vos iz gekumen oif im, un zei zainen gekumen itlecher fun zain ort, Elifaz der Temani, un Bildad der Shuchi, un Tsofar der Naamati; un zei hobn opgeredt in einem tsu gein im badoyern un im treistn. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />un az zei hobn oifgehoibn zeyere oign fun der vaitn, hobn zei im nisht derkent, un zei hobn oifgehoibn zeyer kol un hobn geveint; un zei hobn itlecher tserisn zain mantl, un gevorfn shtoib iber zeyere kep tsum himel. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />un zei zainen gezesn mit im oif der erd zibn teg un zibn necht, un keiner hot nisht geredt tsu im a vort, vorem zei hobn gezen az der veitog iz zeyer grois.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" altnumber="1" sid="JOB 2:14" /> <char style="vp">3.1</char> dernoch hot Iyov geefent zain moil, un hot gesholtn zain tog.<verse eid="JOB 2:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" pubnumber="ג" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" altnumber="2" sid="JOB 3:1" /> <char style="vp">3.2</char> un Iyov hot zich opgerufn, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" altnumber="3" sid="JOB 3:2" /> untergein zol der tog</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:2">vos ich bin in im geborn gevorn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:2">un di nacht vos hot ongezogt:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:2">a zochor iz antfangen gevorn.<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" altnumber="4" sid="JOB 3:3" /> yener tog zol zain choishech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">nisht fregn zol oif im Eloah fun oiben,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">un nisht shainen zol oif im a lichtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" altnumber="5" sid="JOB 3:4" /> tsunemen far zich zoln im choishech un toitshotn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">a volkenish zol ruen oif im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">chmares fun tog zoln im shrekn.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" altnumber="6" sid="JOB 3:5" /> yene nacht, a shtokfintsternish zol zi nemen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">zi zol zich nisht freyen in di teg fun yor,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">in der tsol fun chodeshim zol zi nisht araingein.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" altnumber="7" sid="JOB 3:6" /> ot yene nacht zol zain vist,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">nisht kumen in ir zol a gezang.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" altnumber="8" sid="JOB 3:7" /> fluchn zoln zi di vos shiltn dem tog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">di vos zainen greit dem lioiotn oiftsuvekn.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" altnumber="9" sid="JOB 3:8" /> fintster zoln vern ire ovntshtern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">zi zol hofn oif licht, un nishto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">un nisht onzen di bremen fun frimorgn.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" altnumber="10" sid="JOB 3:9" /> vail zi hot nisht farshlosn di tirn fun main muterlaib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">un farborgen maternish fun maine oign.<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" altnumber="11" sid="JOB 3:10" /> far vos bin ich nisht fun tracht geshtorbn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">arois fun laib un fargangen?<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" altnumber="12" sid="JOB 3:11" /> almai hobn mich kni tsugenumen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">un noch vos brist, ich zol zeign?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" altnumber="13" sid="JOB 3:12" /> vorem ich volt atsund gelegn un geven shtil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">ich volt geshlafn, ich volt ru gehat dentsmol;<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" altnumber="14" sid="JOB 3:13" /> mit mlochim un yoetsim fun der erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">vos farboien vistenishn far zich;<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" altnumber="15" sid="JOB 3:14" /> oder mit srores vos hobn gold,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">vos filn zeyere haizer mit zilber.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" altnumber="16" sid="JOB 3:15" /> oder ich volt gornisht geven, vi a bahaltener mapl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">vi kinder vos hobn dem shain nisht gezen.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" altnumber="17" sid="JOB 3:16" /> dort hern oif di reshoim tsu rudern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">un dort ruen di mide on koiech.<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" altnumber="18" sid="JOB 3:17" /> in einem barut zainen di gefangene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">zei hern nisht dem kol fun a driker.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" altnumber="19" sid="JOB 3:18" /> klein un grois iz dortn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">un der knecht iz frai fun zain har.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" altnumber="20" sid="JOB 3:19" /> far vos git er licht dem vos matert zich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">un lebn di farbiterte in gemit?<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" altnumber="21" sid="JOB 3:20" /> di vos harn oifn toit, un er kumt nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">un zei akeren noch im mer vi noch oitseres;<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" altnumber="22" sid="JOB 3:21" /> di vos voltn zich freyen mit simche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">vos voltn kveln, az zei voltn gefinen dem keyver;<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" altnumber="23" sid="JOB 3:22" /> tsu dem man vos zain veg iz farborgen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">un Eloah hot fartsamt far im?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" altnumber="24" sid="JOB 3:23" /> vorem glaich vi main broit kumt main ziftsn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">un azoi vi vaser gisn zich maine geshreyen.<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" altnumber="25" sid="JOB 3:24" /> vorem di angst vos ich hob geangst iz mir ongekumen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">un vos ich hob geforcht iz mir geshen.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" altnumber="26" sid="JOB 3:25" /> ich hob kein shalve un kein ru</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">un kein menuche nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">un tsiterenish iz gekumen.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" pubnumber="ד" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />hot geentfert Elifaz der Temani, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />az me pruvet a vort tsu dir vet dich fardrisn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">ober ver ken zich ainhaltn fun reid?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />ze, host gelernt filn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">un shlafe hent flegstu shtarkn.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />dem geshtroichltn flegn oifshteln daine reid,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">un gebeigte kni flegstu festikn.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />ober atsund kumt es tsu dir, verstu ophentik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">es rirt dich on, un verst dershrokn.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />iz nisht dain yiras dain bitochen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">dain hofenung di erlechkeit fun daine vegen?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />dermon zich nor, ver iz umshuldik untergegangen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">un vu zainen rechtfartikn fartilikt gevorn?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />vedlik ich hob gezen, iz di vos akeren umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">un zeyen umglik, zei shnaidn es.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />fun dem hoich fun Eloah geyen zei unter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">un fun dem otem fun zain tsorn vern zei farlendt.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />a gebril fun leib, a kol fun vildleib –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">ober di tsein fun di yungleibn vern tsebrochn;<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />der alter leib geit ois on shpaiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">un di kinder fun der leibinte vern tseshpreit.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />un tsu mir flegt a vort zich fargnven,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">un main oier hot farnumen a kvint derfun.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />in gedanken, fun zeungen fun der nacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">ven a tifer shlof falt oif mentshn,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />hot mich a pachad getrofn un a tsiterenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">un hot ale maine beiner shoidert.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />un a gaist flegt far main ponem ariber;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">kapoir shteln flegt es di hor fun main laib.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />er flegt shtein, ober ich fleg nisht derkenen zain onblik;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">a geshtalt iz geven far maine oign;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">a shtilkeit un a Sheetim fleg ich hern:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />ken a mentsh far Eloah zain gerecht?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">tsi ken far zain Bashefer rein zain a man?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />ze, in zaine knecht gloibt er nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">un in zaine malachim merkt er a farze,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />haint vi shoin di voiner in haizer fun leim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">vos zeyer grunt iz in shtoib?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">me tsedrikt zei glaich vi a moil.<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />tsvishn morgn un ovnt vern zei tseshtoisn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">umgemerkt geyen zei unter oif eibik.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />far vor, opgerisn vert zeyer getseltshtrik bai zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">zei shtarbn, un on chochme.<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" pubnumber="ה" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />ruf akorsht, oib iz do ver zol dir entfern?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">un tsu vemen fun di heilike vestu zich kern?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />vorem dem narn harget der kaas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">un dem nisht klugn teit di kine.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />ze ich a narn aingevortslt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">ruf ich tikf zain voinung farsholten .<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />zaine kinder veln vait zain fun hilf,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">un zei veln tsedrikt vern in toier,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">un keiner vet nisht matsl zain.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />vorem zain shnit vet der hungeriker oifesn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">un biz fun di derner vet er es aveknemen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">un ainshlingen vet di nets zeyer farmeg.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />far vor, nisht fun shtoib kumt arois umglik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">un nisht fun der erd shprotst maternish.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />naiert a mentsh iz tsu maternish geborn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">azoi vi funken flien aroif.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />ober ich volt gezucht El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">un tsu Elokim volt ich geshtelt main taine;<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />der vos tut groise zachn nisht tsu derforshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">vunder azh on a tsol;<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />der vos git regn oifn gezicht fun der erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">un shikt vaser oifn gezicht fun di felder;<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />er shtelt di niderike in der heich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">un di fintstere vern derhoibn durch hilf.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />er farshtert di machshoves fun di listike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">az zeyere hent zoln nisht oifton mamoshes.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />er fangt kluge in zeyer listikeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">un di eitse fun di farshpitste vert tsetumlt.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />bai tog bagegenen zei fintsternish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">un azoi vi bai nacht tapn zei in mitn tog.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />un er helft fun der shverd – fun zeyer moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">un fun dem shtarkns hant dem evyon.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />un der oreman krigt hofenung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">un umgerechtikeit macht tsu ir moil.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />ze, voil iz dem mentshn vos Eloah shtroft im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">un dem musar fun Shaddai zolstu nisht farachten.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />vorem er macht vei ton, un er farbindt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">er farvundt, un zaine hent ton es vider heiln.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />in zeks tsores vet er dich matsl zain,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">un in zibn vet dich nisht onrirn kein beiz.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />in hunger vet er dich oisleizen fun toit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">un in milchome fun der macht fun shverd.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />far der rut fun der tsung vestu zain farborgen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">un vest nisht moire hobn far farvistung, az zi kumt.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />fun farvistung un fun hunger vestu lachn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">un far di chayes fun der erd vestu nisht moire hobn.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />vorem mit di shteiner fun feld vet zain dain bris,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">un di chaye fun feld vet zain sholem mit dir.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />un vest visen az dain getselt iz besholem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">un vest nochzen dain voinung, un bai dir vet nisht feln.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />un vest visen az dain zomen vet zain fil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">un daine shprotsungen vi groz fun der erd.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />vest kumen in fuler elter tsum keyver,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">vi a shein tvue kumt arain in zain tsait.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />ze, dos hobn mir oisgeforsht, azoi iz dos,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">her es tsu, un du merk dir.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" pubnumber="ו" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />ven gevoign zol gevoign vern main kaas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">un main broch volt men nemen oifn vogshol baglaich!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />vorem shverer fun dem zamd fun yamen volt es zain atsund;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">derum zainen maine verter tsemisht.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />vorem in mir zainen di failn fun Shaddai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">vos zeyer gift trinkt main ruach;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">shrekenishn fun Eloah shteln zich ois kegen mir.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />shrait den a valdeizl oif groz?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">tsi meruket an oks oif zain futer?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />vert umbatemts gegesn on zalts?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">tsi iz do a tem in dos vaisl fun ei?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />vos main zel hot nisht gevolt onrirn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">dos zainen di tsushpaizn fun main broit.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />halevay kumt on main farlang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">un main hofenung git Eloah!<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />un Eloah vilikt ain un tsedrikt mich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">lozt loiz zain hant un derendikt mich!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />volt dos noch geven main nechome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">un ich volt getonst in yesurim;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">zol er zain umderbaremdik;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">hagam ich hob nisht geleiknt</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">on di verter fun heilikn.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />vos iz main koiech, az ich zol hofn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">un vos main sof, az ich zol ainhaltn main gemit?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />iz der koiech fun shteiner main koiech?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">iz main laib fun kuper?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />iz den far mir kein hilf nishto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">un an eitse iz farshtoisen fun mir?<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />dem vos geit ain kumt rachmones fun zain chever,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">afile er farlozt di moire faran Shaddai.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />maine brider hobn gefelsht vi a taich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">vi der shtrom fun taichn vos geyen avek,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />vos zainen tunkel fun aiz –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">oif zei bahalt zich der shnei.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />beeis zei vern tsevaremt, vern zei farshvundn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">vi es vert heis, tsegeyen zei fun zeyer ort.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />es dreyen zich di vegen fun zeyer vander,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">zei fargeyen in nisht un vern farlorn.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />di karavanen fun Tema hobn oisgekukt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">di machnus fun Sheva hobn gehoft oif zei,<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />ober zei hobn zich geshemt vos zei hobn zich farzichert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">zei zainen ongekumen biz ahin un in shand geblibn.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />far vor, atsund zait ir mit im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">ir hot derzen dem broch, un zich dershrokn.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />hob ich den gezogt: git mir vos,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">un fun aier farmeg shenkt far mir?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />oder: macht mich antrinen fun soines hant,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">un fun der hant fun gevalttuer zolt ir mich oisleizen?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />lernt mich, un ich vel shvaign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">un vos ich hob farzen, git mir tsu farshtein.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />vi shtark zainen richtike verter!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">ober vos bavaizt dos bavaizn fun aich?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />rechnt ir verter far a bavaiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">un far vint di reid fun fartsveifltn?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />afile oif a yosem volt ir goirl vorfn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">un ir volt grobn oif aier chever.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />un atsund bavilikt, kert aich tsu mir;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">un tsi vel ich aich in ponem a lign zogn?<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />kert aich um, ich bet aich, zol kein avle nisht geshen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">yo, kert aich vider um, ich bin gerecht derin.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />iz in main tsung do umrecht?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">tsi shpirt nisht main gumen farbrechn?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" pubnumber="ז" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />far vor, dinsttsait hot der mentsh oif der erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">un vi teg fun a gedungenem zainen zaine teg.<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />vi a knecht vos shmacht noch shotn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">un vi a gedungener vos hart oif zain loin,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />azoi hob ich mir tsugeteilt gekrign chodeshim fun umglik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">un necht fun maternish hot men mir tsugetseilt.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />az ich leig zich, zog ich: ven vel ich oifshtein?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">un di nacht tsit zich, un ich ver zat mit varfenish bizn frimorgn.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />main laib iz bakleidt mit verem un shtiker erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">main hoit platst un vert tsekrochn.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />maine teg zainen flinker fun a vebshifl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">un vern farlendt on a hofenung.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />gedenk, az a hoich iz main lebn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">main oig vet nisht onzen mer guts.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />mich vet mer nisht onkukn dos oig fun main zeer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">daine oign zainen oif mir, un shoin bin ich nishto.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />farlendt vert a volken un fargeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">azoi der vos nidert in Sheol, vet nisht aroifkumen.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />er vet zich mer nisht umkeren in zain hoiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">un zain ort vet im mer nisht kenen.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />derum vel ich nisht farmaidn main moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">ich vel redn in der klemenish fun main gemit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">ich vel klogn in der biterkeit fun main zel.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />bin ich a yam, oder a yam-chaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">vos du shtelst a vach iber mir?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />az ich zog: main bet vet mich treistn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">main geleger vet mittrogn main klog,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />shrekstu mich mit chaloimes,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">un mit zeungen groilstu mich.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />un main zel vil beser dervargenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">toit, eider di dozike beiner maine.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />mir iz nimes; ich vel eibik nisht lebn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">loz op fun mir, vorem a hoich zainen maine teg.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />vos iz der mentsh, az du zolst im greisn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">un az du zolst leign oif im dain harts,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />un im dermonen ale frimorgn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">ale rege im pruvn?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />vi lang vestu zich nisht opkeren fun mir?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">mich nisht oplozen biz ich shling arop main shpaiechts?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />az ich zindik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">vos tu ich dir, hiter fun dem mentshn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">far vos hostu mich gemacht far dain tsilbret,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">az ich bin gevorn zich alein tsu last?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />un vos fargistu nisht main farbrech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">un tust nisht op main zind?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">vorem atsund vel ich lign in shtoib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">un vest mich zuchn, un ich vel nisht zain.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" pubnumber="ח" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />hot geentfert Bildad der Shuchi, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />biz vanen vestu redn dos dozike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">un vi a shtarker vint veln zain di verter fun dain moil?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />vet den El fardreyen dem mishpot?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">un vet Shaddai fardreyen di gerechtikeit?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />az daine kinder hobn gezindikt tsu im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">hot er zei avekgeshikt far zeyer farbrech.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />az du volst zuchn El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">un tsum Shaddai betn,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />az du volst zain rein un rechtfartik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">volt er atsund zich dervekn far dir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">un gants machn dain gerechte voinung.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />un oib dain onheib vet zain klein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">vet dain sof zain zeyer grois.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />vorem freg akorsht dem frierdikn dor,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">un merk vos zeyere eltern hobn oisgeforsht<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />– vorem mir zainen fun nechtn, un veisn gornisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">vail a shotn zainen undzere teg oif der erd –<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />far vor, zei veln dich lernen, zei veln dir zogn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">un fun zeyer hartsn aroisbrengen verter?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />ken oisvaksn ror on a zump?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">ken grois vern taichgroz on vaser?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />noch iz es in zain grinkeit, nisht opgeshnitn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">un vi gore hei vert es fartriknt.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />azoi zainen di vegen fun ale G-tfargeser,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">un di hofenung fun dem zindikn geit unter.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />vorem zumerfodem iz zain farzicherung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">un shpinvebs zain bitochen.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />er lent zich on oif zain hoiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">ober es hot nisht kein bashtand,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">er halt zich deron,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">ober es blaibt nisht shtein.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />zaftik iz er far der zun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">un iber zain gortn geit arois zain shprots.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />in a hoifn flechtn zich zaine vortselen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">tsvishn shteiner raist er zich durch.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />ober fartilikt men im fun zain ort,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">farleiknt er im: ich hob dich nisht gezen.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />ot dos iz di freid fun zain veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">un fun der erd shprotst an anderer arois.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />ze, El faracht nisht dem umshuldikn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">un vet nisht oifhaltn di hant fun dem shlechtstuer;<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />biz er vet onfiln mit gelechter dain moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">un daine lipn mit shalung.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />daine sonem veln zich onkleidn mit shand,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">un dos getselt fun di reshoim vet mer nisht zain.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" pubnumber="ט" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />emes, ich veis az azoi iz es;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">ober vi ken a mentsh gerecht zain far El?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />az er zol veln zich krign mit im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">volt er im nisht gekent entfern eins fun toiznt.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />klug in hartsn, un shtark in koiech –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">ver ken zich ekshnen kegen im un arois gants?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />der vos rukt iber berg, un zei merkn nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">ven er kert zei iber in zain tsorn.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />der vos treislt oif di erd fun ir ort,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">az ire zailn tsiteren.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />der vos heist der zun, un zi shaint nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">un di shtern farchasmet er.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />er hot oisgeshpreit di himlen alein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">un er tret oif di heichn fun yam.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />er hot gemacht dem bershtern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">dem orion un dem zibnshtern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">un di kamern fun dorem.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />er tut groise zachn azh nisht tsu derforshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">un vunder azh on a tsol.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />ot geit er mir farbai, un ich ze nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">un er tsit durch, un ich merk im nisht.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />ot chapt er avek – ver ken im ophaltn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">ver ken im zogn: vos tustu?<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Eloah kert nisht op zain tsorn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">unter im hobn zich geboign di helfer fun rahav.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />haint vi shoin ken ich im entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">klaibn maine verter kegen im?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />vos afile ich zol gerecht zain, ken ich nisht entfern;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">betn muz ich zich bai dem vos mishpot mich.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />afile ich zol rufn un er zol entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">volt ich nisht gloibn az er hot farnumen main kol.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />er vos tsereibt mich mit shturemvint,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">un mert maine vundn bechinam.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />er lozt mich main otem nisht optsien,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">naiert er zetikt mich mit biternishn.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />oib in koiech, iz er machtiker,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">un oib oif a mishpot: ver ken mich lodn?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />afile ich zol zain gerecht, vet main moil mich farshuldikn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">ich meg zain umshuldik, vet er mich machn far krum.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />ich bin umshuldik;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">mich art nisht main nefesh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">mir iz nimes main lebn.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />es iz alts eins, derum zog ich:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">dem umshuldikn azoi vi dem roshe farlendt er.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />ven di rut teit plutsling,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">shpot er oif dem goysesn fun di umshuldike.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />di erd iz ibergegebn in der hant fun roshe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">dem ponem fun ire richter fardekt er;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">oib nisht, ver den iz dos?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />un maine teg zainen flinker fun a loifer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">zei zainen antlofn, nisht ongezen guts.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />zei zainen avek glaich vi rorshifn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">vi an odler vos shvebt oifn esen.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />az ich zog, ich vel fargesen main klog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">avekvarfn main umetik ponem, un zich oifmuntern,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />shrek ich zich far ale maine veitogn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">ich veis az du vest mir nisht shenken.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />shuldik muz ich blaibn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">to noch vos zol ich mich mien umnisht?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />az ich volt zich gevashn mit shneivaser,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">un gereinikt mit loig maine hent,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />vestu dentsmol in a grobn mich aintunken,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">az maine kleider veln zich eklen mit mir.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />vorem nisht a mentsh vi ich iz er, ich zol im entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">mir zoln in einem tsum mishpot gein.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />nishto tsvishn undz kein antsheider,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">vos zol leign zain hant oif undz beidn.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />zol er opton fun mir zain rut,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">un zain eime zol mich nisht shrekn,<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />vel ich redn, un nisht moire hobn far im;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">ober es iz nisht vi bai mir.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" pubnumber="י" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />mir alein eklt main lebn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">ich vel fun mir loiz lozn main klog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">ich vel redn in der biterkeit fun main zel.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />ich vel zogn tsu Eloah: zolst mich nisht shuldik machn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">loz mich visen far vos du krigst zich mit mir.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />iz dir gut az du drikst,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">az du farachtst di mi fun daine hent,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">un dem barot fun di reshoim bashainstu?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />zainen oign fun fleish bai dir?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:4">tsi zestu vi a mentsh zet?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />zainen vi di teg fun a mentshn daine teg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">tsi daine yorn vi di teg fun a man?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />az du zuchst main zind,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">un forsht main chet,<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />hagam du veist az ich bin nisht shuldik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">nor nishto ver zol matsl zain fun dain hant.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />daine hent hobn mich gefuremt un gemacht</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">mit alem mit anander, doch tust du mich fardorben.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />gedenk fort, az vi leim hostu mich gemacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">un tsu shtoib vestu mich umkeren.<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />far vor, vi milch hostu mich oisgegosen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">un vi kez hostu mich farglivert.<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />mit hoit un fleish hostu mich bakleidt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">un mit beiner un odern geflachtn.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />lebn un genod hostu mir bashert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">un dain obacht hot opgehit main gaist.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />ober dos hostu bahaltn in dain hartsn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">ich veis az dos hostu gehat in zinen:<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />az ich zindik, vestu mich hitn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">un fun main chet mich nisht rein machn.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />az ich bin shuldik, iz vei tsu mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">un bin ich gerecht, ken ich nisht oifheibn dem kop,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">zat mit shand, un zeendik main pain.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />un heibt er zich oif, yogstu mich vi a leib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">un alts vider bageistu zich mshunh kegen mir.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />banaist daine eides kegen mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">un merst dain kaas oif mir;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">gebitn nochanand vert der cheil kegen mir.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />un noch vos hostu mich fun tracht aroisgetsoign?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">ich volt fargangen, un an oig volt mich nisht ongezen.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />vi nisht geven volt ich geven,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">fun muterlaib volt ich tsum keyver gebracht gevorn.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />maine teg zainen doch vintsik, to her oif,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">un tu zich op fun mir, ich zol zich oifmuntern a bisel,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />eider ich gei avek zich nisht umtsukeren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">in a land fun choishech un toitshotn,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />a land tunkel vi di fintsternish alein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">toitshotn on ordenung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">vu afile az es shaint, iz vi fintsternish.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" pubnumber="יא" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />hot geentfert Tsofar der Naamati, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />zol der filredevdiker blaibn nisht geentfert?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">un tsi zol der lipnmentsh blaibn gerecht?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />daine ploideraien machn mentshn shvaign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">un du shpotst, un zol dich keiner nisht farshemen?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />un du zogst: loiter iz main lernung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">un rein bin ich in daine oign.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />ober halevay redt Eloah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">un efent zaine lipn mit dir,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />un dertseilt dir di farborgenishn fun klugshaft,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">vi filfachik di chochme iz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">un volst visen az Eloah mont fun dir</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">vintsiker vi dain zind.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />vilstu di derforshung fun Eloah gefinen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">tsi dem tsil fun Shaddai gefinen?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />es iz hoich vi di himlen, vos kenstu oifton?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">tifer fun Sheol, vos kenstu visen?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />lenger fun der erd iz di mos derfun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">un breiter fun yam.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />az er geit farbai un farshlist,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">oder er zamlt ain, ver ken im ophaltn?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />vorem er veis di falshe lait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">un er zet dos umrecht, on tsu mol a kuk ton.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />ober der puster mentsh vet krign seichel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">ven a yunger valdeizl vet ibergeborn vern in a mentshn.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />az du vest tsukern dain harts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">un oisshpreitn tsu im daine hent –<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />oib umrecht iz in dain hant, dervaiter es,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">un zolst nisht lozn ruen in daine getseltn an avle –<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />dentsmol vestu oifheibn dain ponem on a flek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">un vest fest zain, un nisht moire hobn.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />vorem di maternish vestu fargesen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">vi vaser vos iz avek vestu es dermonen.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />un heler vi mitn tog vet oifshtein dain lebn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">di fintsternish vet vi der morgn vern.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />un vest zain zicher, vail hofenung iz do,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">un vest zich arumkukn, un lign in zicherkeit.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />un vest hoiern, un keiner vet nisht shrekn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">un fil veln zuchn dain laitzelikeit.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />ober di oign fun di reshoim veln oisgein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">un antrinung vet zain farlorn fun zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">un zeyer hofenung – an oishoichenish fun der neshome.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" pubnumber="יב" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />emes yo, ir zait di lait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">un mit aich vet opshtarbn di chochme!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />ich hob oich farshtandikeit azoi vi ir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">ich fal nisht arop kegen aich;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">un ver veis nisht azelche zachn vi di dozike?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />a gelechter baim chever bin ich gevorn –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">der vos hot gerufn tsu Eloah, un er hot im geentfert;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">a gelechter – der gerechter, der frumer.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />dem umgliklechn kumt farachtung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">vedlik di gedanken fun dem gliklechn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">a shtois – di vos zeyer fus glitsht zich ois.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />beshalve zainen di getseltn fun di roiber,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">un in zicherkeit di vos dertserenen El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">der vos brengt zain Eloah in zain foist.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />ober freg akorsht di beheimes, un zei veln dich lernen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">un dem foigel fun himel, un er vet dir zogn;<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />oder red tsu der erd, un zi vet dich lernen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">un dir veln dertseiln di fishn fun yam.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />ver tsvishn ale dozike veis nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">az di hant fun Hashem hot dos gemacht?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />az in zain hant iz di zel fun yetveder lebedikn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">un der gaist fun yetveder mentshns laib.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />darf nisht dos oier pruvn verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">azoi vi der gumen farzucht zain shpaiz?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />iz bai graizn di chochme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">un in aricht-yamim farshtandikeit? –<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />bai im iz chochme un gevure,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">er hot etsut un farshtandikeit.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />ze, er tseshtert, un es vert nisht opgeboit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">er farshlist a mentshn, un es vert nisht geefent.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />ze, er farhalt vasern, un zei vern oisgetriknt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">un er shikt zei arois, un zei kern iber di erd.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />bai im iz macht un klugshaft,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">zainer iz i der farfirter i der farfirer.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />er macht umgein di yoetsim banumene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">un di richter banarisht er.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />di musar fun di mlochim macht er loiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">un oif zeyere lendn bindt er a shtrikgartl.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />er macht umgein di koyanim banumene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">un di machtike fardreit er.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />er nemt op dem loshen bai di baredevdike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">un dem seichel fun di zkeinim nemt er avek.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />er gist farachtung oif firshtn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">un dem ongurt fun di shtarke macht er loiz.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />er antplekt tifenishn fun der fintster,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">un brengt arois in licht dem shotn fun toit.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />er derheicht di felker, un brengt zei unter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">er shpreit ois di felker, un firt zei avek.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />er tut op dem seichel fun di hoiptlait fun dem folk fun land,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">un macht zei blondzhen in a vistenish on a veg.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />zei tapn in choishech on licht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">un er macht zei vaklen vi a shiker.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" pubnumber="יג" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />ze, alts hot gezen main oig,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">main oier hot gehert un zich gemerkt.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />vi ir veist, veis ich oich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">ich fal nisht arop kegen aich.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />ober ich vil tsum Shaddai redn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">un tenhn tsu El vil ich.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />ir ober zait shmirer fun lign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">nishtike roifim zait ir ale.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />halevay volt ir shvaign geshvigen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">volt dos fun aich a chochme geven.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />hert akorsht main taine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">un di krig fun maine lipn farnemt.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />vilt ir far El redn umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">un far im redn batrug?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />vilt ir zain ponem shaneven,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">tsi vilt ir far El zich krign?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />vet gut zain az er vet aich oisforshn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">tsi vi me nart a mentshn vet ir im opnarn?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />shtrofn vet er aich shtrofn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">oib ir vet in farborgenish shaneven.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />far vor, zain groiskeit vet aich dershrekn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">un zain pachad vet faln oif aich.<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />aiere baishpiln zainen geglichn tsu ash,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">tsu hoifns leim aiere reid hoifns.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />lozt mich op, un ich vel redn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">un zol kumen oif mir vos vil.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />meg zain vos, ich vel nemen main fleish in maine tsein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">un main lebn vel ich ainshteln in main hant.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />ot vet er mich teitn – ich richt zich oif im –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">ober maine vegen vel ich oifvaizn far im.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />shoin dos vet mir zain a hilf,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">vos far im ken kein falsher nisht kumen.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />hern hert tsu main vort,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">un main aroiszog mit aiere oiern.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />ot, ich bet aich, leig ich far dem mishpot;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">ich veis az ich vel zain gerecht.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />ver iz der vos ken krign mit mir?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">vorem dentsmol volt ich shvaign un fargein.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />nor tsvei zachn zolstu nisht ton mit mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">dentsmol vel ich far dain ponem zich nisht farborgen:<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />dain hant dervaiter fun mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">un dain eime zol mich nisht shrekn.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />un ruf, un ich vel dir entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">tsi ich vel redn, un entfer du mir.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />vifel hob ich zind un chatoim?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">main farbrech un main chet loz mich visen.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />far vos farborgstu dain ponem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">un rechnst mich far a soine tsu dir?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />tsi a getribn blat vilstu ainshrekn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">un a fartrikntn shtroi vilstu nochyogn?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />vos du shraibst mir on biternishn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">un machst mich yarshen di zind fun main yugnt;<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />un tust arain in a klots maine fis,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">un hitst ale maine shtegn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">arum maine fustrit griblstu zich.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />un ich bin vi a logl vos tsekricht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">vi a beged vos moil hot im tsefresn.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" pubnumber="יד" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />der mentsh, geborn fun a froi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">hot kurtse teg un zat fardros.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />vi a blum kumt er arois un vert farshnitn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">un er antloift vi a shotn un bashteit nisht.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />un oif azelchn haltstu ofen daine oign?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">un mich vilstu brengen tsum mishpot mit dir?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />ver ken machn rein fun umrein?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">kein einer nisht.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />oib zaine teg zainen tsugeshnitn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">di tsol fun zaine chodeshim iz bai dir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">grenetsn hostu im gemacht vos er ken nisht ariber,<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />ker zich op fun im, kedei er zol hobn ru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">biz er vet derfiln vi a gedungener zain tog.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />vorem far a boim iz do a hofenung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">az er vert opgeshnitn, banait er zich vider,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">un zain shprots hert nisht oif.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />az alt in der erd vert zain vortsel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">un in shtoib shtarbt op zain shtam,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />fun reyech fun vaser blit er oif,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">un lozt ritlech arois vi a flantsung.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />ober a man shtarbt un falt avek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">un fargangen der mentsh, un vu iz er?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />vasern geyen avek fun yam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">un a taich vert oisgetriknt un trukn;<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />un der mentsh leigt zich un shteit nisht oif;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">biz kein himel vet nisht zain veln zei zich nisht oifchapn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">un nisht oifvachn fun zeyer shlof.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />ven du volst mich in Sheol bahaltn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">mich farborgen biz dain tsorn vet opgein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">mir shteln a tsait, un zich dermonen on mir! –<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />az a mentsh shtarbt, vet er den lebedik vern? –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">ale teg fun main dinsttsait volt ich gehart</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">biz main oisbait vet kumen.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />volst gerufn, un ich volt dir geentfert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">ven du volst geglust tsu dem verk fun daine hent.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />ober atsund tseilstu maine trit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">vartst tsu mol nisht oif main chet.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />farchasmet in a baitl iz main farbrech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">un du leigst noch tsu tsu main zind.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />yo far vor, a gefalener barg tsebreklt zich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">un a feldz vert farrukt fun zain ort;<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />vaser tseraibt shteiner,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">ire fleitsungen shvenken avek dem shtoib fun der erd;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">azoi brengstu unter di hofenung fun dem mentshn.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />shtarkst im eibik iber, un er fargeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">farenderst zain ponem, un shikst im avek.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />zaine kinder hobn koved, un er veis nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">un zei vern tsu klein, un er merkt zei nisht.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />nor zain fleish veitokt oif im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">un zain zel troiert oif im.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" pubnumber="טו" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />hot geentfert Elifaz der Temani, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />vet a chochem entfern mit kenshaft fun luft,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">un onfiln mit mizrech-vint zain boich?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />tenhn reid vos toign nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">un verter vos me brengt kein nuts nisht mit zei?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />oich farshterstu di yiras,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">un minerst di frumkeit far El.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />vorem dain zind lernt dain moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">un klaibst ois di tsung fun di listike.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />dain eigen moil macht dich shuldik, un nisht ich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">un daine lipn zogn eides kegen dir.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />bistu der ershter mentsh geborn gevorn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">oder bistu far di berg bashafn gevorn?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />hostu dem sod fun Eloah aingehert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">un avekgenumen tsu zich di chochme?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />vos azoins veistu, vos mir veisn nisht?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">farshteistu, vos bai undz iz nishto?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />i a groer kop i a graiz iz do tsvishn undz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">elter fun dain foter in teg.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />zainen dir vintsik di treistungen fun El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">un dos vort vos iz mild tsu dir?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />vos nemt dich dain harts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">un vos vinken daine oign,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />az du kerst kegen El dain gaist,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">un lozt arois reid fun dain moil?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />vos iz a mentsh, az er zol zain rein?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">un ken den gerecht zain a geborener fun a froi?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />ze, in zaine heilike gloibt er nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">un di himlen zainen nisht rein in zaine oign,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />haint vi shoin der umverdiker un fardorbener,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">der mentsh, vos trinkt umrecht vi vaser?<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />ich vel dir basheidn, her mir tsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">un vos ich hob gezen vel ich dertseiln;<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />vos di chachomim gibn iber –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">un farhoiln nisht – fun zeyere eltern,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />vos tsu zei alein iz gegebn gevorn dos land,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">un kein fremder iz nisht durchgegangen tsvishn zei.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />ale zaine teg iz in tsiterenish der roshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">un getseilte yorn zainen ongebreit dem gevalttuer.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />a kol fun angstn iz in zaine oiern:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">in mitn sholem vet kumen a farvister oif im.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />er gloibt nisht zich oistsudreyen fun fintsternish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">un er iz oisgeklibn faran shverd.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />er voglt um noch broit: vu iz es?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">er veis az lebn im iz ongebreit der tog fun fintsternish.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />im shrekn angst un drikenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">zei chapn im on vi a melech ongebreit tsum krig.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />vail er hot oisgeshtrekt kegen El zain hant,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">un kegen Shaddai zich geshtarkt;<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />gelofn kegen im mit a shtoltsn haldz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">mit di dike rukns fun zaine shildn.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />vail er hot badekt zain ponem mit zain fets,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">un ongeleigt plostn oifn lend;<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />un er hot bavoint farviste shtet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">haizer vos me zitst nisht in zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">vos zainen geven ongebreit oif hoifns.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />er vet nisht raich zain, un nisht bashtein vet zain farmeg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">un nisht naign vet zich tsu der erd zeyer tvue.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />er vet zich nisht opton fun fintsternish;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">zain shprots vet fartrikenen a flam,<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />un er vet opgeton vern durch a hoich fun zain moil.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">zol nisht troien oif nisht der farnarter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">vorem nisht vet zain zain ainbait.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />eider zain tog kumt, vet es derfilt vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">un zain tsvaig vet nisht grin zain.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />er vet opshoklen vi a vainshtok zain umtsaitiks,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">un aropvarfen vi an eilbertboim zain bliung.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />vorem dos gezeml fun di zindike blaibt vist,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">un a faier fartsert di getseltn fun shochad.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />zei trogn umrecht un gebern umglik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">un zeyer laib breit on far zich opnarung.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" pubnumber="טז" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />ich hob gehert fil azoins;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">tsoredike treister zait ir ale.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />vet zain a sof tsu di vintike reid?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">oder vos shpart dich az du zolst entfern?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />ich volt oich gekent redn vi ir</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">az ir volt geven oif main ort;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">ich volt geknipt verter oif aich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">un geshoklt oif aich main kop.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />ich volt aich geshtarkt mit main moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">un der badoier fun maine lipn volt aich gelindert.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />az sai ich red, vert nisht geminert main veitog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">un sai ich her oif, geit er fun mir nisht avek;<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />far vor, atsund hot er mich farmatert;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">host tsegroilt main gantse gezelnshaft.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />un host mich tsekneitsht –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">tsum eides iz es gevorn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">un main mogerkeit shteit oif kegen mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">mir in ponem klogt zi on.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />zain tsorn hot fartsukt mit faintshaft,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">er hot gekritst oif mir mit zaine tsein;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">main soine shlaift zaine oign oif mir.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />me shpart oif dos moil oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">mit shand patsht men maine bakn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">in einem klaibn zei zich oif mir.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />El entfert mich iber tsum farbrecher,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">un in di hent fun reshoim vorft er mich.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />ruik bin ich geven, un er hot mich tsebreklt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">un mich ongenumen baim genik, un mich tsepitslt;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">un er hot mich oifgeshtelt far zain tsilbret.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />mich ringlen arum zaine shiser,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">er shpalt maine nirn, un derbaremt nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">er gist ois tsu der erd main gal.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />er tsebrecht mich a broch oif a broch,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">er loift kegen mir vi a krigsman.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />zak hob ich oifgeneit oif main hoit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">un gevelgert in ash main horn.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />main ponem iz roit fun gevein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">un oif maine bremen iz shotn fun toit,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />far kein umrecht, nisht in maine hent,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">beeis main tfile iz rein.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />erd, zolst nisht tsudekn main blut,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">un zol nisht kein ort zain far main geshrei!<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />afile itst ot iz in himel main eides-zoger,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">un main meilets iz oich in der heich.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />maine firshpechers zenen maine shpeters;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">tsu Eloah tut trifn main oig,<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />halevay az er zol mishpetn tsvishn a man mit Eloah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">vi tsvishn a mentshnkind un zain chever.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />vorem di getseilte yorn geyen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">un ich vel avek oif a veg fun vanen ich vel zich nisht umkeren.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" pubnumber="יז" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />main gaist iz tseveitokt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">maine teg zainen farloshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">der keyver iz far mir.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />far vor, shpeter zainen mit mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">un oif zeyer ergern muz ruen main oig.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />ker zich tsu, ich bet dich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">zai orev far mir bai dir alein;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">ver den zol mir a hantshlog gebn?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />vorem zeyer harts hostu farborgen fun seichel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">tsum richtikn tustu zei nisht derheibn.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />der vos masert fun Chelek vegen chaverim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">azh oisgein zoln di oign fun zaine kinder!<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />yo, er hot mich geshtelt far a vertl bai lait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">un tsu shpaien in ponem bin ich gevorn.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />un tunkel fun ergernish iz main oig,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">un maine glider zainen vi a shotn ale.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />di rechtfartikn vern tsegroilt deriber,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">un der umshuldiker vert oifn zindikn oifgebracht.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />un der gerechter zol onhaltn zain veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">un der vos hot reine hent zol mern shtarkeit!<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />ir ale ober kumt akorsht vider aher,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">un ich vel nisht gefinen a klugn tsvishn aich.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />maine teg zainen fargangen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">maine gedanken zainen tserisn –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">di trachtenishn fun main hartsn.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />nacht far tog machn zei:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">nont iz dos licht vail es iz fintster.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />az ich richt zich oif der Sheol vi main heim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">in fintsternish bet ich ois main geleger,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />tsum keyver ruf ich: bist main foter!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">main muter un main shvester tsum vorem,<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />haint vu den iz main hofenung?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">yo, main hofenung ver vet zi onzen?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />tsu di riglen fun Sheol vet zi nidern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">ven in einem in shtoib veln mir ruen.<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" pubnumber="יח" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />hot geentfert Bildad der Shuchi, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />biz vanen vet ir machn geyegn oif verter?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">batracht, un dernoch veln mir redn.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />far vos vern mir gerechnt vi beheimes,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">gehaltn far farshtopt in aiere oign?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />du vos fartsukst zich alein in dain tsorn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">zol fun dainet vegen farlozt vern di erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">un a feldz avekgerukt vern fun zain ort?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />yo, dos licht fun di reshoim vet farloshn vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">un nisht shainen vet der funk fun zain faier.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />di lichtikeit vet fintster vern in zain getselt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">un zain licht vet farloshn vern iber im.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />di shpraizn fun zain macht veln geengt vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">un im vet anidervarfn zain eigene eitse.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />vorem er vert getribn fun zaine fis in der nets,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">un oif a pastke geit er um.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />chapn faran trit vet a fangnets,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">fest vet im haltn der knup.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />bahaltn in der erd iz a shtrik far im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">un a chapshtaig far im iz oifn shteg.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />rund arum groiln im shrekenishn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">un zei yogn im oif zaine trit.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />hungerik vet zain zain umglik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">un der broch iz ongebreit bai zain zait.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />oifesn vet di glider fun zain laib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">oifesn vet zaine glider der bechor fun toit.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />oisgerisn vet vern fun zain getselt zain farzicherung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">un es vet im machn shpraizn tsu dem melech fun shrekenish.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />ruen vet in zain getselt nisht zain hob;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">oif zain voinung vet oisgeshpreit vern shvebl.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />fun unten veln trikenen zaine vortselen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">un fun oiben vet farvelkt vern zain tsvaig.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />zain zocher geit unter fun der erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">un er hot nisht kein nomen deroisn.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />me vet im shtoisn fun licht in fintsternish</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">un fun der velt vet men im farvoglen.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />er hot nisht kein kind un kein einikl tsvishn zain folk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">un kein iberblaib in zaine voinungen.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />iber zain shtroftog vern tsegroilt di shpeterdike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">un di frierdike nemt on a shoider.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />yo, dos zainen di voinungen fun dem farbrecher,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">un dos iz der ort fun dem vos veis nisht fun El.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" pubnumber="יט" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />biz vanen vet ir batribn main zel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">un mich tsedrikn mit verter?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />shoin tsen mol az ir baleidikt mich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">ir shemt aich nisht mich tsu painiken.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />un az ich hob shoin yo farzen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">vet bai mir doch blaibn main farze.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />oib ir vilt in der emes zich greisn kegen mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">un mir forvorfn main shand,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />to veist az Eloah hot mich gekrivdet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">un zain nets arumgeleigt arum mir.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />ot shrai ich gevalt, un ver nisht geentfert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">ich ruf, un nishto kein gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />main veg hot er fartsamt, az ich ken nisht durchgein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">un oif maine shtegn hot er a fintsternish aroifgeton.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />main koved hot er oisgeton fun mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">un aropgenumen di kroin fun main kop.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />er tseshtoist mich rund arum, az ich fargei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">un er hot oisgerisn vi a boim main hofenung.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />un er hot ongetsundn zain tsorn oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">un er rechnt mich far zainem a soine.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />in einem kumen oif mir zaine machnus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">un zei tretn ois zeyer veg kegen mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">un zei lagern arum main getselt.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />maine brider hot er dervaitert fun mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">un maine bakente zainen in gantsn farfremdt fun mir.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />maine kroivim haltn zich tsurik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">un maine gute fraint hobn mich fargesen.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />maine hoizvoiner un maine dinstn rechenen mich far a fremdn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">an umbakenter bin ich gevorn in zeyere oign.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />ich ruf main knecht, un er entfert nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">ich bet zich bai im mitn moil.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />main otem iz tsuvider main vaib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">un ich farekl main brider.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />afile yinglech farachten mich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">ich shtel zich, un zei redn mir akegn.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />mich farumverdikn ale maine fartroite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">un di vos ich hob lib, kern zich kegen mir.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />tsu main hoit un tsu main fleish</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">iz tsugeklept main gebein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">un ich bin arois mit di yasles fun maine tsein.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />derbaremt aich oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">derbaremt aich oif mir, ir chaverim maine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">vorem di hant fun Eloah hot mich getrofn.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />far vos roideft ir mich azoi vi El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">un kent zich nisht onzetn mit main fleish?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />halevay vern nor oifgeshribn maine verter!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">halevay vern zi in a buch fartseichnt!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />mit an aizerner pen un blai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">oif eibik in feldz aingehakt!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />vorem ich veis, main oisleizer lebt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">un dos er vet in di letste teg oifshtein oif der erd.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />un chotsh di vorem veln dernoch maine hoit fardorben,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">doch vel ich in main fleish G-t zen!<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />az ich alein zol zen far mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">un maine oign zoln onkukn, un nisht kein anderer –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">geyen ois maine nirn in main laib.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />ven ir zogt: vi veln mir im roidefn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">azoi vi der vortsel fun der zach volt zich gefunen in mir,<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />hot moire far der shverd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">vorem mit grimtsorn zainen di shtrofn fun der shverd;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">derum zolt ir visen az a mishpot iz faran.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" pubnumber="כ" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />hot geentfert Tsofar der Naamati, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />derum entfern mir maine gedanken –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">fun vegen vos ich shpir in mir:<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />dem shtrof fun main shand hob ich gehert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">un a gaist fun main farshtand entfert mir.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />veistu dos vos iz fun eibik on,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">fun zint der mentsh iz gemacht oif der erd?<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />az dos gezang fun reshoim iz oif kurtsn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">un di simche fun zindikn oif a rege?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />ven bizn himel zol aroifgein zain heich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">un zain kop zol bizn volken dergreichn,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />vet er vi zain eigen koit oif eibik untergein;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">zaine zeer veln zogn: vu iz er?<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />vi a cholem vet er avekflien, un me vet im nisht gefinen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">un er vet faryogt vern vi a zeung fun der nacht.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />dos oig hot im ongekukt, un nisht mer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">un mer vet im nisht onzen zain ort.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />zaine kinder veln fargitikn di orime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">yo, zaine eigene hent veln tsurikgebn zain guts.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />zaine beiner zainen ful mit zain yugnt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">ober mit im in shtoib vet zi zich leign.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />hagam zis iz dos beiz in zain moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">er bahalt es unter zain tsung,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />er shoint es, un lozt es nisht op,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">un halt es tsu oif zain gumen,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />vert zain shpaiz farkert in zaine ingeveid,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">gal fun shlangen iz ineveinik bai im.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />farmeg hot er aingeshlungen, un vet es oisbrechn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">fun zain boich vet es El aroistraibn.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />gift fun shlangen flegt er zoign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">vet di tsung fun a noter im hargen.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />er vet nisht onzen di bechn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">di taichnshtromen fun honik un shmant.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />er git tsurik zain mi, un vet es nisht aropshlingen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">vi shtark zain farmeg, vet er zich dermit nisht onfreyen.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />vail er hot tsedrikt, hefker gelozt di orime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">gegzlt a hoiz vos er hot nisht geboit.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />vail er hot nisht gevust kein ru in zain laib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">vet er mit zain shats nisht antrunen vern.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />nishto kein iberblaib fun zain freseray,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">derum vet zain guts nisht gevern.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />ven zain krop iz ful, vet im eng vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">vu a hant fun an umgliklechn, vet kumen oif im.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />er vet haltn bai onfiln zain boich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">vet er onshikn oif im zain grimtsorn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">un machn regenen oif im mit zain shpaiz.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />er vet antloifn fun an aizernem vafn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">vet im durchlechern a kuperner boign.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />er tut a tsi, un es kumt arois fun laib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">yo, di blitsike fail geit arois fun zain gal;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">imut zainen oif im.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />gore fintsternish iz bahaltn far zaine oitseres,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">im vet fartseren a faier fun keinem nisht oifgeblozn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">es vet opesen dem iberblaib in zain getselt.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />di himlen antplekn zain zind,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">un di erd shtelt zich oif kegen im.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />avek vet der ainkum fun zain hoiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">es vert tserunen in tog fun zain tsorn.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />dos iz der chelek fun dem shlechtn mentshn fun Elokim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">un zain basherte yerushe fun El.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" pubnumber="כא" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />hern hert tsu main vort,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">un zol dos zain aiere treistungen.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />lozt mich az ich zol redn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">un noch main redn vestu oplachn.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />iz kegen a mentshn main klog?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">un far vos zol nisht kurts vern main gemit?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />kert zich tsu mir, un vert banumen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">un tut aroif di hant oifn moil.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />az vi ich dermon zich azoi ver ich dershrokn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">un main laib nemt on a shoider.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />far vos lebn di reshoim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">eltern zich, un zainen shtark in kraft?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />zeyer zomen shteit fest far zeyer ponem bai zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">un zeyere shprotsn far zeyere oign.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />zeyere haizer zainen besholem, on angst,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">un di rut fun Eloah iz nisht oif zei.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />zain oks bafruchpert un farfelt nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">zain ku kelbt zich un farvorft nisht.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />zei shikn arois vi shof zeyer yungvarg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">un zeyere kinder tantsn arum.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />zei zingen mit poik un harf,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">un freyen zich tsum kol fun der fleit .<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />zei farbrengen in guts zeyere teg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">un ruik nidern zei in Sheol.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />un zei zogn tsu El: ker zich op fun undz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">un mir viln nisht visen fun daine vegen.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />vos iz Shaddai, az mir zoln im dinen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">un vos veln mir nutsn, az mir veln betn tsu im? –<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />zeyer guts iz doch nisht in zeyer hant;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">der barot fun di reshoim iz vait fun mir.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />vi oft iz dos az dos licht fun reshoim zol farloshn vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">un es zol kumen oif zei a broch?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">er zol zei oisteilen yesurim in zain tsorn?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />zei zoln vern vi shtroi faran vint,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">un vi shprei vos der shturem ganvet im avek?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Eloah bahalt zain umrecht far zaine kinder –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">zol er im alein batsoln az er zol visen.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />zoln zaine oign zen zain umglik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">un fun grimtsorn fun Shaddai zol er trinken.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />vorem vos kimert im zain hoizgezint noch im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">ven di tsol fun zaine chodeshim iz geendikt?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />ken men El lernen farshtandikeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">az er mishpot di hechste?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />der shtarbt in zain rechter shtarkeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">in gantsn ruik un beshalve;<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />zaine emers zainen ful mit milch,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">un der march fun zaine beiner iz gezeftikt.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />un der shtarbt in a biter nefesh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">un hot nisht farzucht kein guts.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />in einem in shtoib lign zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">un verem dekn zei tsu.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />ich veis doch aiere machshoves,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">un vi ir kligt zich mit gevalt akegn mir,<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />az ir zogt: vu iz dos hoiz fun dem srorh?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">un vu dos getselt fun dem roshes voinung?<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />hot ir nisht gefregt bai di vegforer?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">ir vet doch nisht farleikenen zeyere bavaizn,<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />az in dem tog fun broch vert geshoint der shlechter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">in dem tog ven shtrofn vern gebracht.<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />ver zogt im in ponem zain veg?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">un vos er hot geton ver batsolt im?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />vorem er vert gebracht tsu kvure,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">un oifn bergel past men oif.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />zis zainen im di shtiker erd fun tal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">un noch im tsien zich ale mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">un im farois on a tsol.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />un vi vilt ir mich treistn mit gornisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">az aiere tshuvut blaibn an opnar?<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" pubnumber="כב" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />hot geentfert Elifaz der Temani, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />brengt den der mentsh a nuts El?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">naiert zich alein brengt a nuts der farshtandiker.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />hot Shaddai a toive az du bist a tsadik?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">oder a gevin az du bist erlech in daine vegen?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />tsi vegen dain yiras shtroft er dich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">un geit tsum mishpot mit dir?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />iz nisht dain shlechtikeit grois,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">un on a shieur daine zind?<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />vorem flegst nemen a meshkun bai daine brider umzist,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">un di begadim fun di nakete flegstu oiston.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />a trunk vaser dem farshmachtn flegstu nisht gebn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">un fun dem hungerikn flegstu farmaidn broit.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />yo, dem man mitn orem, im gehert di erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">un der ongezeener, er meg voinen oif ir.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />almones hostu avekgeshikt mit leidikn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">un di orems fun yesoimim flegn tsedrikt vern.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />derum zainen netsn rund arum dir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">un dich shrekt a plutsimdiker pachad,<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />oder a fintsternish, az du kenst nisht zen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">un a fleitsung vaser fardekt dich.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />far vor, Eloah iz in der heich fun di himlen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">un ze, di hechste shtern vi derhoibn zei zainen;<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />un du zogst: vos veis El?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">tsi ken er durchn nebl mishpetn?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />volkens zainen im a farborgenish, un er zet nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">un iber dem tsirkl fun himel geit er um.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />vilstu onhaltn dem alten veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">vos di lait fun umrecht hobn getretn?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />di vos zainen aingegangen far der tsait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">vos zeyer gruntfest iz vi a taich tserunen gevorn;<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />di vos hobn gezogt tsu El: ker zich op fun undz!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">un vos ken zei ton Shaddai?<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />beeis er hot ongefilt zeyere haizer mit guts –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">yo, di trachtung fun di reshoim iz vait fun mir. –<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />di gerechte hobn gezen, un zich gefreit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">un der umshuldiker hot geshpet fun zei:<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />far vor, fartilikt gevorn iz zeyer bashtand,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">un zeyer shefe hot fartsert dos faier.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />baken zich nor mit im, un zai in frid –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">durch dem vet dir onkumen guts.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />nem nor tsu lernung fun zain moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">un tu arain zaine verter in dain hartsn.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />az du vest zich umkeren tsum Shaddai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">vestu oifgericht vern –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">az du vest dervaitern umrecht fun daine getseltn.<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />un vorf in shtoib dos goldarts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">un tsvishn geshtein fun di toln dos Ofir-gold;<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />un Shaddai zol zain dain goldarts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">un kruves zilber bai dir.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />vorem dentsmol vestu mitn Shaddai zich kvikn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">un vest oifheibn tsu Eloah dain ponem.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />vest betn tsu im, un er vet dich tsuhern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">un daine nedrim vestu batsoln.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />un vest bashlisn a zach, un zi vet dir tsu shtand kumen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">un oif daine vegen vet shainen a lichtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />az me hot dich dernidert, hostu gezolt zogn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">es iz a derheibung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">vorem er helft dem vos halt niderik di oign.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />vu an umshuldikn macht er antrinen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">un vest antrunen vern durch der reinkeit fun daine hent.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" pubnumber="כג" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />haint oich iz biter main klog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">main hant iz shver fun vegen main ziftsn.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />halevay veis ich vu ich gefin im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">vi ich kum tsu zain ort!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />ich volt forgeleigt far im dem mishpot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">un main moil volt ich ongefilt mit tainus.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />ich volt visen vos er volt mir entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">un farshtein vos er volt mir zogn.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />volt er mit grois koiech gekrigt mit mir?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">nein; naiert acht geton volt er oif mir.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />dentsmol volt der rechtfartiker getenht mit im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">un ich volt oif eibik antrunen fun main richter.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />ze, ich gei farois, un er iz nishto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">un ahinter, un ich merk im nisht;<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />links az er iz farton, ze ich nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">er fardreit zich rechts, un ich merk nisht.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />ober er veis dem veg vos bai mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">er hot mich gepruvet, ich bin vi gold arois.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />on zain trit hot zich gehaltn main fus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">zain veg hob ich gehit, un zich nisht opgeneigt.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />vu a gebot fun zaine lipn, hob ich zich nisht opgekert;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">mer vi main oiskumenish hob ich gehit di verter fun zain moil.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />ober er halt zich bai eins, un ver ken im ophaltn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">un zain zel bagert, un er tut.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />yo, er vet oisfirn vos mir iz bashert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">un fil azoins iz noch do bai im.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />derum bin ich dershrokn far im;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">ich batracht, un hob moire far im.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />un El hot shlof gemacht main harts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">un Shaddai hot mich aingeshrokn.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />vorem ich bin nisht oisgemekt gevorn fun dem choishech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">un far main ponem hot fardekt a fintsternish.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" pubnumber="כד" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />far vos zainen nisht opgeleigt</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">fun Shaddai bashtimte tsaitn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">un di vos kenen im, zeen nisht zaine teg?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />grenetsn farrukt men,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">a stade gazlt men un me fitert.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />dem eizl fun yesoimim firt men avek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">me nemt in meshkun dem oks fun der almone.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />me shtoist arop evyonim fun veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">bahaltn muzen zich ale orime fun land.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />ze, vi vilde eizlen in midber,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">geyen zei arois tsu zeyer arbet, zuchendik shpaiz;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">di step git im broit far di kinder.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />oifn feld shnaidn zei zain futer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">un dem vaingorten fun roshe klaibn zei op.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />naket nechtikn zei, on a malbesh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">un on a tsudek fun kelt.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />fun dem regngus fun di berg vern zei durchgenetst,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">un on a shitsung tulien zei zich tsum feldz.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />me roibt fun der brust dem yosem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">un baim oreman nemt men a meshkun.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />naket geyen zei, on a malbesh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">un zei nemen fun di hungerike zeyere getreid garbn.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />tsvishn di moiern fun yene, presen zei eil;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">kelters tretn zei un zainen dorshtik.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />fun shtot krechtsn di mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">un di zel fun gusse shrait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">un Eloah macht nisht kein forvurf.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />zei zainen vidershpeniker on licht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">zei kenen nisht zaine vegen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">un vailn nisht oif zaine shtegn.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />mitn shain shteit oif der merder,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">tsu teitn dem oreman un dem evyon;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">un bai nacht iz er vi a ganev.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />un dos oig fun noyef vort oif farnacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">azoi tsu zogn: mich vet nisht onzen an oig;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">un a tsudek oifn ponem tut er on.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />zei grobn unter in der fintster haizer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">bai tog farshlisn zei zich ain;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">zei veisn nisht fun lichtikeit,<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />vorem bai zei alemen iz toitshotn frimorgn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">vail zei zainen bakant mit di shrekenishn fun toitshotn.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />er geit laicht avek oifn vaser;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">farsholten iz zeyer chelek oif der erd;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">er farkert nisht oifn veg fun vaingertner.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />trikenish un hits roibn avek shneivaser;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">un Sheol – di vos hobn gezindikt.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />der tracht fargest on im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">der vorem lobt zich mit im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">er vert mer nisht gedacht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">un tsebrochn vi a holts vert umgerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />er chavert zich mit der akore vos gebert nisht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">un di almone bagitikt er nisht.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />un er shlept arop di machtike mit zain koiech;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">er shteit oif, un me iz nisht zicher mitn lebn.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />lozt im in zicherkeit, er zol zich onlenen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">ober zaine oign zainen oif zeyere vegen.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />zei vern derhoibn a vaile, un shoin zainen zei nishto;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">yo, zei vern dernidert, vi ale vern zei aingezamlt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">un vi a shpits zang vern zei opgeshnitn.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />un oib nisht azoi, den, ver vil mir opleikenen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">un machn tsu nisht main vort?<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" pubnumber="כה" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />hot geentfert Bildad der Shuchi, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />geveltikeit un forchtikeit zainen bai im;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">er shaft sholem in zaine heichn.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />iz do a tsol tsu zaine machnus?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">un oif vemen geit nisht oif zain licht?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />un vi ken den a mentsh gerecht zain mit El?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">un vi ken rein zain a geborener fun a froi?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />ze, azh di levone iz nisht hel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">un di shtern zainen nisht rein in zaine oign,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />haint vi shoin a mentsh a vorem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">un a mentshnkind a milb?<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" pubnumber="כו" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />hot geentfert Iyov, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />vi hostu geholfn dem vos on koiech!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">baigeshtanen dem orem on macht!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />vi hostu geeitset dem vos on chochme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">un klugshaft a sach gelozt visen!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />mit vemes hilf hostu gezogt di verter?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">un vemes otem iz aroisgegangen fun dir?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />di meisim tsiteren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">di vasern fun unten mit zeyere bavoiner.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />naket iz Sheol far im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">un on a tsudek iz der opgrunt.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />er shpreit ois dem tsofn iber dem tohu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">er hengt oif di erd oif gornisht.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />er bindt ain di vasern in zaine chemares,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">un nisht tseplatst vert der volken unter zei.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />er fardekt dem ponem funem tron,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">er farshpreit zain volken iber im.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />er hot getsirklt a grenets oifn vaser,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">biz tsum sof fun licht un fintsternish.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />di zailn fun himel treislen zich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">un vern tsetumlt fun zain ongeshrei.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />mit zain koiech tserudert er dem yam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">un mit zain farshtandikeit tsehakt er rahav.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />durch zain otem vert loiter der himel;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">zain hant hot araingeshtocht di loifike shlang.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />ze, dos zainen teil fun zaine vegen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">un vos far a klein murml hern mir fun im!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">ober dem duner fun zaine gevuros ver ken farshtein?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" pubnumber="כז" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />un Iyov hot vider oifgehoibn zain gereid, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />azoi vi es lebt El vos hot tsugenumen main recht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">un der fun Shaddai vos hot farbitert main zel,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />az oib kol-zman main otem iz in mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">un der hoich fun Eloah in main noz,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />oib maine lipn veln redn umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">un oib main tsung vet aroislozn batrug!<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />cholile mir, az ich zol aich gebn gerecht!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">biz ich vel oisgein vel ich nisht lozn opnemen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">main erlechkeit fun mir.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />on main gerechtikeit halt ich zich un vel zi nisht oplozen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">main harts hot fun main lebtog on mir nisht fortsuvarfn.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />zol vern fun main faint vi fun roshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">un fun main kegnshteyer vi fun dem farbrecher!<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />vorem vos iz di hofenung fun dem zindikn, az er havet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">oib Eloah nemt avek zain zel?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />vet El hern zain geshrei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">az oif im vet kumen a tsore?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />tsi ken er zich kvikn mitn fun Shaddai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">rufn tsu Eloah in yetveder tsait?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />ich vel aich lernen vegen der hant fun El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">vos iz baim fun Shaddai vel ich nisht farhoiln.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />ot hot ir ale gezen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">un far vos den ploidert ir nishtiks?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />dos iz der chelek fun dem shlechtn mentshn bai El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">un di arav vos di gevalttuer krign fun Shaddai.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />oib zaine kinder mern zich, iz dos faran shverd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">un zaine shprotsn veln nisht hobn broit tsu zat.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />di vos blaibn fun im veln fun pest bagrobn vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">un zaine almones veln tsu mol nisht baveinen.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />az er zol onzamlen vi shtoib zilber,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">un vi leim ongreitn malbushem,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />vet er ongreitn, un der gerechter vet onton,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">un mitn zilber veln di umshuldike zich teiln.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />er boit vi a moil zain hoiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">un vi a baidl vos der vechter macht.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />er leigt zich an oysher, un shoin iz nishto vos oiftsuklaibn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">er efent zaine oign, un es iz nishto.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />vi vasern yogn im on shrekenishn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">iber nacht ganvet im avek a shturem.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />der mizrech-vint heibt im oif, az er muz gein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">un er shturemt im avek fun zain ort.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />un er shlaidert oif im un derbaremt zich nisht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">loifndik volt er antlofn fun zain hant.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />me patsht iber im di hent,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">un me shmutsert oif im fun zain ort.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" pubnumber="כח" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />yo, faran a greberai far zilber,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">un an ort vu gold tut men laitern.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />aizn vert fun der erd genumen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">un fun shtein shmeltst men kuper.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />der mentsh macht a sof tsu fintsternish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">un biz yetveder ek forsht er ois</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">shteiner fun fintsternish un toitshotn.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />er brecht a shacht vait fun a bavoiner;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">fargesen fun a farbaigeyers fus;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">opgetsert, vait fun mentshn vandern zei.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />di erd, fun ir kumt arois broit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">ober unter ir iz ibergekert vi fun faier.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />der ort fun safir zainen ire shteiner,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">un shtoibn fun gold zainen derin.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />dem shteg, im veis nisht kein roibfoigl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">un nisht ongekukt hot im dos oig fun a falk.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />nisht batretn hobn im chayes shtoltse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">nisht geshpraizt hot oif im der leib.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />tsum kizlshtein shtrekt er ois zain hant,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">er kert um fun vortsel di berg.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />in feldzn hakt er grobns,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">un al dos taierste kukt on zain oig.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />flusn farbindt er nisht tsu rinen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">un farborgns brengt er arois in licht.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />ober di chochme fun vanen ken gefunen vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">un vu iz der ort fun farshtandikeit?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />kein mentsh veis nisht ir verde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">un zi gefint zich nisht in land fun di lebedike.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />der tehom zogt: nisht in mir;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">un der yam zogt: nisht bai mir.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />far ir ken nisht gegebn vern faingold,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">un zilber ken nisht gevoign vern far ir mekch.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />zi ken nisht opgeshatst vern mit Ofir-gold,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">mit taiern onikl un sapirshtein.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />gold un glaz zainen nisht ir glaichn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">un keilim fun gingold ir oisbait.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />avnim toivus un kristol darfn nisht dermont vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">un mer fun kareln iz der batref fun chochme.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />tafaz fun Kush iz nisht ir glaichn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">mit reinem gold ken zi nisht opgeshatst vern.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />to fun vanen kumt di chochme?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">un vu iz der ort fun farshtandikeit?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />az zi iz farhoiln fun di oign fun yetveder lebedikn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">un fun foigel fun himel iz zi farborgen.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />untergang un toit zogn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">mit undzere oiern hobn mir gehert ir herung.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Elokim farshteit ir veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">un er veis ir ort.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />vorem er kukt biz di ekn erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">untern gantsn himel zet er.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />ven er hot gemacht faran vint a vog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">un vasern markirt mit a mos,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />ven er hot gemacht faran regn a gezets,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">un a veg faran dunergeviter,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />dentsmol hot er zi gezen un zi barechnt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">zi oifgeshtelt un oich zi oisgeforsht.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />un er hot gezogt tsum mentshn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">ze, moire far Adonoi dos iz chochme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">un zich opkeren fun shlechts iz farshtandikeit.<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" pubnumber="כט" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />un Iyov hot vider oifgehoibn zain gereid,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:1">un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />ver macht mich azoi vi in di chodeshim fun a mol,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">vi in di teg vos Eloah hot mich opgehit!<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />ven zain licht hot geshaint iber main kop,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">ven far zain shain fleg ich gein in der fintster.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />azoi vi ich bin geven in di teg fun main yugnt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">ven di fartroitkeit fun Eloah iz geven oif main getselt;<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />ven Shaddai iz noch geven mit mir;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">rund arum mir maine kinder.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />ven maine trit hobn zich gebodn in shmant,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">un der feldz hot gegosn bai mir bechn mit eil.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />az ich bin aroisgegangen tsum toier in shtot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">oifgeshtelt in mark main zits,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />hobn yungelait gezen un zich bahaltn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">un graizn hobn zich oifgehoibn un geshtanen.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />harn hobn zich aingehaltn fun verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">un di hant flegn zei aroifton oif zeyer moil.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />der kol fun groise lait hot zich bahaltn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">un zeyer tsung hot zich tsugeklept tsu zeyer gumen.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />vorem vu an oier hot gehert, hot mich geloibt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">un vu an oig hot gezen, hot mir tsugeshtimt.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />vail ich fleg rateven dem oreman vos hot geshrien,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">un dem yosem vos hot nisht kein helfer.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />di broche fun dem umgliklechn flegt kumen oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">un dos harts fun der almone fleg ich derfreyen.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />ich hob ongeton rechtfartikeit, un zi hot mich ongeton,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">vi a mantl un a hoib iz geven main gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />oign bin ich geven faran blindn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">un fis faran hinkedikn bin ich geven.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />ich bin geven a foter far di baderftike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">un dem mishpot fun dem vos ich hob nisht gekent,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">fleg ich oisforshn.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />un ich hob tsebrochn di baktsein fun dem farbrecher,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">un fun zaine tseiner aroisgevorfn dem roib.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />un ich hob gezogt: bai main nest vel ich fargein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">un vi der zamd vel ich mern teg.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />main vortsel vet zain ofen tsum vaser,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">un der toi vet nechtikn oif main tsvaig.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />main koved vet blaibn frish bai mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">un main boign vet in main hant zich banayen.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />tsu mir hot men zich tsugehert un gevart,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">un me flegt harn oif main eitse.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />noch main zog flegt men mer nisht redn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">un oif zei flegt trifn main vort.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />un zei hobn gevart vi oif regn oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">un oifgeshpart zeyer moil vi oif shpetregn.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />az ich fleg lachn tsu zei, flegt zich zei nisht gloibn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">un dos licht fun main ponem flegn zei nisht minern.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />ich fleg oisklaibn zeyer veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">un fleg zitsn oiben on,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">un ruen vi a melech tsvishn cheil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">vi der vos tut troierer treistn.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" pubnumber="ל" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />un atsund lachn fun mir yingere fun mir in teg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">vos ich hob mich gemiust tsu shteln zeyere foters</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">mit di hint fun maine shof –<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />yo, tsu vos mir der koiech fun zeyere hent?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">zeyer frishkeit iz geven farlorn –<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />di vos zainen fun noit un hunger aingedart,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">vos nogn di trikenish in fintsterer vistkeit un vistenish.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />di vos raisn zaltskraitechts mit vermut,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">un vortsel fun bezembeimlech zich ontsuvaremen.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />fun tsvishn mentshn vern zei fartriben,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">me shrait oif zei vi oif a ganev.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />in mordike toln muzen zei voinen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">in lecher fun der erd un feldzn.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />tsvishn di beimlech brumen zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">unter a dorn zainen zei tsunoifgenuret.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />gemeine yungen un yungen on a nomen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">vos zainen oisgeshtoisn fun land.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />un atsund bin ich zeyer lidl gevorn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">un ich bin far a vertl bai zei.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />zei farumverdikn mich, zei dervaitern zich fun mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">un zei haltn zich nisht op mir in ponem tsu shpaien.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />vorem main boignshtrik hot er loiz gemacht un mich geboign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">un zei vorfn arop di tsam far mir.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />oif rechts shtelt zich oif dos yungvarg;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">zei shtoisn maine fis,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">un tretn ois kegen mir zeyere vegen fun umglik.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />zei hobn tserisn main shteg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">zei helfn main broch; kein helfer zol zei nisht zain!<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />vi a breiter vaserbroch kumen zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">mit shturem kaiklen zei zich aroif.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />shrekenishn zainen gekert kegen mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">zei yogn vi a vint main gdulh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">un vi a volken iz avek main hilf.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />un atsund tsegist zich in mir main zel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">teg fun pain hobn mich ongenumen.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />di nacht boiert maine beiner fun mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">un maine odern lign nisht ain.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />fun grois shtarkeit fun main krenk iz main malbesh farbaiten;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">vi der kolner fun main mantl gurt zi mich arum.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />er hot mich gevorfn in koit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">un ich bin geglichn tsu shtoib un ash.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />ich shrai tsu dir, un du entferst mir nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">ich shtei, un du kukst mich on.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />bist farkert gevorn in an achzer tsu mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">mit der macht fun dain hant faintstu mich.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />heibst mich oif oifn vint, machst mich raitn deroif,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">un machst tsegein main kraft.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />yo, ich veis, vest tsum toit mich brengen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">un tsum zamlhoiz fun ale lebedike.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />ven er vet nisht shtrekn zaine hent tsu di vos zenen in di grub,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">chotsh zei shraien in der broch?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />tsi hob ich nisht geveint faran shver gedriktn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">main zel hot doch gekumert faran evyon.<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />ober ich hob gehoft oif guts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">un shlechts iz gekumen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">un ich hob gehart oif licht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">un fintsternish iz gekumen.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />maine ingeveid kochn un ruen nisht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">teg fun pain zainen gekumen oif mir.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />fintster gei ich um, on zun;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">ich shtei oif in a gezeml un shrai.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />ich bin gevorn a bruder tsu shakaln,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">un a chever tsu shtroisfoiglen.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />main hoit iz shvarts gevorn oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">un main gebein iz tsebrent fun hits.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />un gevorn tsu troier iz main harf,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">un main fleit tsu a kol fun gevein.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" pubnumber="לא" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />a bris hob ich geshlosn mit maine oign;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">un vos zol ich kukn oif a yungfroi?<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />vorem vos iz der chelek fun Eloah fun oiben,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">un di arav fun Shaddai fun der heich?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />oib nisht a broch faran farbrecher,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">un umglik far di tuer fun umrecht?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />zet er den nisht ale maine vegen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">un tseilt ale maine trit?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />oib ich bin umgegangen mit lign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">un geailt tsu batrug hot main fus –<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />zol er mich vegen oif richtike vogsholn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">un Eloah vet visen main umshuld –<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />oib main trit hot zich opgeneigt fun veg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">un noch maine oign iz gegangen main harts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">un in maine hent hot zich ongeklept a flek,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />zol ich zeyen, un an anderer zol esen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">un maine shprotsungen zoln oisgevortslet vern.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />oib main harts iz farfirt gevorn noch a froi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">un ich hob geloyert bai der tir fun main chever,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />zol moln far an andern main vaib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">un andere zoln knien iber ir.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />vorem dos iz a shendlechkeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">un dos iz a zind tsum farmishpeten.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />vorem dos iz a faier vos fartsert biz untergang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">un main gantse tvue volt es oisgevortslet.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />oib ich fleg farachten dos recht fun main knecht un main dinst</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">in zeyer krig mit mir –<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />vos volt ich den geton, az El zol oifshtein?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">un az er volt gemont, vos volt ich im geentfert?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />hot nisht der vos hot mich in muterlaib bashafn, im bashafn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">un der eigener im in tracht gefuremt?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />oib ich fleg farmaidn dem farlang fun di orime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">un di oign fun der almone lozn oisgein;<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />oder ich fleg esen main bisn alein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">un der yosem hot derfun nisht gegesn –<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />nein, fun main yugnt on iz er oifgevaksn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">bai mir vi bai a foter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">un fun main muterlaib on fleg ich zi firn.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />oib ich fleg tsuzen an umgliklechn on a malbesh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">un on a tsudek dem evyon;<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />oib zaine lendn hobn mich nisht gebentsht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">vail mitn opsher fun maine shof flegt er zich dervaremen;<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />oib ich hob gehoibn oif a yosem main hant,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">vail ich fleg zen maine helfer in toier,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />zol main aksl fun zain nakn aropfaln,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">un main orem zol fun gelenk oisgebrachn vern.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />vorem der broch fun El iz geven main shrek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">un fun vegen zain groiskeit fleg ich zich nisht dervegn.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />oib ich hob gemacht gold main hofenung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">un oif gingold gezogt main bitochen;<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />oib ich fleg zich freyen vail main farmeg iz grois,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">un vail main hant hot dergreicht a sach;<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />oib ich fleg tsukukn di zun vi zi shaint,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">oder di levone prachtik geyendik,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />un main harts iz farfirt gevorn in farborgenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">un main moil hot gekusht main hant;<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />volt dos oich geven a zind tsum farmishpeten,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">vorem ich volt geleiknt on El in der heich.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />oib ich fleg zich freyen oif dem broch fun main soine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">un bin geven oifgeramt az im hot getrofn beiz –<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />az ich hob tsu mol nisht gelozt main gumen zindikn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">tsu betn a klole oif zain lebn –<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />oib di mentshn fun main getselt hobn nisht gezogt:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">ver ken vaizn einem vos hot zich nisht ongezet mit fleish bai im? –<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />oif der gas flegt nisht nechtikn a fremder,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">maine tirn tsum veg fleg ich efenen –<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />oib ich hob fardekt</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">azoi vi Adam maine farbrechn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">tsu bahaltn in main buzem main zind,<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />vail ich fleg moire hobn faran groisn hamon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">un di farachtung fun mishpoches flegt mich shrekn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">un ich hob geshvigen un bin fun tir nisht arois –<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />halevay krig ich er zol mir tsuhern!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">ot iz main untershrift, zol Shaddai mir entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">un a geshrifts zol onshraibn main baal-din.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />far vor, ich vel es oif main aksl trogn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">ich vel es mir onbindn azoi vi a kroin.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />di tsol fun maine trit vel ich im dertseiln;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">azoi vi a firsht vel ich tsu im genenen.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />oib main erd shrait ois kegen mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">un ale ire beitn veinen;<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />oib ir kraft hob ich gegesn on gelt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">un di neshome fun ire arbeter gelozt oishoichn,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />zol anshtot veits oifgein a dorn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">un anshtot gersht vildgeveks.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40" />
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">geendikt di verter fun Iyovn.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" pubnumber="לב" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />un di dozike drai mener hobn oifgehert entfern Iyovn, vail er iz geven gerecht in zaine oign.<verse eid="JOB 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />hot gegrimt der tsorn fun Elihu dem zun fun Barakhel dem Buzi fun der mishpoche Ram; oif Iyovn hot gegrimt zain tsorn far vos er macht zich gerechter fun Elokim, <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />un oif zaine drai gute fraint hot gegrimt zain tsorn far vos zei hobn nisht gefunen an entfer, fun dest vegen hobn zei bantshuldikt Iyovn. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />un Elihu hot opgevart mit reid akegn Iyovn, vail zei zainen geven elter fun im in teg. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />ober az Elihu hot gezen az kein entfer iz nishto in moil fun di drai mener hot gegrimt zain tsorn.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />un Elihu der zun fun Barakhel dem Buzi hot zich opgerufn un hot gezogt:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 32:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">yinger bin ich fun aich in teg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">un ir zait graizn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">derum hob ich mich geshait un moire gehat</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">aich aroiszogn main gedank.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />ich hob gezogt: teg zoln redn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">un fil yorn zoln machn visen chochme.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />ober es iz ruach in mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">un der otem fun Shaddai vos macht zei farshtandik.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />nisht di groise zainen chachomim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">un nisht di zkeinim farshteyen vos iz gerecht.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />derum zog ich: her mir tsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">lomich oich aroiszogn main gedank.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />zet, ich hob opgevart oif aiere reid,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">ich hob tsugehorcht tsu aiere chochmut,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">beeis ir hot gezucht verter.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />ober ich hob zich tsugekukt tsu aich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">ersht nishto ver zol bavaizn Iyovn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">ver zol entfern zaine verter, fun aich.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />efsher vet ir zogn: mir hobn ongetrofn chochme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">El ken im opshlogn, nisht a mentsh;<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />ober nisht er hot ongericht tsu mir di verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">un nisht mit aiere reid vel ich im entfern.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />zei zainen dershrokn, zei entfern mer nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">opgenumen zainen di verter fun zei.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />un ich zol vartn, vail zei redn nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">vail zei shteyen un entfern mer nisht?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />ich oich vel entfern main chelek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">ich oich vel aroiszogn main gedank.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />vorem ich bin ful mit verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">mich drikt der gaist fun main laib.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />ze, main laib iz vi vain vos iz nisht geefent,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">vi naie loglen vert er tseplatst.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />ich vel redn, un mir vet fraier vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">ich vel efenen maine lipn un entfern.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />lomich nor nisht shoinen kein mans ponem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">un kein mentshn nisht chenfen.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />vorem ich veis nisht vi tsu chenfen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">bald volt mich aveknemen main Bashefer.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" pubnumber="לג" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />ober her akorsht, Iyov, maine reid,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">un ale maine verter farnem.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />ze nor, ich hob geefent main moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">main tsung redt in main gumen.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />oifrichtik fun main hartsn zainen maine verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">un vos maine lipn veisn, zogn zei klor.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />der ruach fun El hot mich gemacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">un der neshome fun Shaddai halt mich baim lebn.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />oib du kenst, entfer mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">breit dich on kegen mir, shtel zich avek.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />ze, ich bin azoi vi du bai El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">ich oich bin fun leim gefuremt gevorn.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />ze, main eime shrekt dich nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">un main last drikt nisht oif dir.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />yo, host gezogt in maine oiern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">un dem kol fun di verter hob ich gehert:<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />rein bin ich, on a farbrech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">loiter bin ich, un hob nisht kein zind:<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />ze, bilbulim gefint er oif mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">er rechnt mich far zain soine;<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />er tut arain in a klots maine fis,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">er hit ale maine shtegn.<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />ot in dem bistu nisht gerecht, vel ich dir entfern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">vorem Eloah iz greser fun mentshn.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />far vos krigstu zich mit im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">vos er farentfert nisht ale zaine meisim?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />vorem oif ein shteiger redt El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">un oif tsvei, hagam me merkt es nisht.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />in a cholem, a zeung fun der nacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">ven a tifer shlof falt oif mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">in shlumer oifn geleger,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />dentsmol antplekt er dem oier fun mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">un farchasmet mit a musar tsu zei,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />kedei der mentsh zol avekvarfn zain ton;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">un er bashiremt fun hoferdikeit dem man.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />er farmaidt zain zel fun shachat,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">un zain lebn fun umkumen durchn shverd.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />oder er vert geshtroft mit veitog oif zain geleger,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">un ale zaine beiner vern shtaif.<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />un zain lebn macht im zich eklen mit broit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">un zain zel mitn glustikstn maichl.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />opgetsert vert zain fleish fun ponem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">un aingedart zaine beiner, nisht ontsukukn.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />un zain zel genent tsu der shachat,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">un zain lebn tsu di teiter.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />oib es iz do far im a malach,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">a meilets-yoisher afile einer fun toiznt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">kedei dem mentshn antsuzgen zaine gerechtfertikung,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />laitzelikt er im, un zogt:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">leiz im ois fun nidern in grub;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">ich hob gefunen an oisleiz.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />zain laib vert frisher vi yinglvaiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">er kert zich um tsu di teg fun zain yugnt.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />er bet tsu Eloah, un er bavilikt im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">un er zet zain ponem mit chein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">un kert um dem mentshn zain gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />er kumt far mentshn vos zogt:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">ich hob gezindikt, un vos iz recht hob ich fardreit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">un es iz mir nisht batsolt.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />azoi leizt er ois zain zel fun gein in grub,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">un zain lebn zet di lichtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />ze, dos alts tut El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">tsvei mol, drai mol, mit a mentshn,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />kedei umtsukeren zain zel fun grub,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">derluchtn tsu vern in licht fun lebn.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />farnem, Iyov, her mir tsu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">shvaig, un ich vel redn.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />oib du host verter, entfer mir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">red, vorem ich vel dich gerecht machn.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />oib nisht, her du mir tsu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">shvaig, un ich vel dich lernen chochme.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" pubnumber="לד" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />un Elihu hot zich opgerufn un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />hert, chachomim, maine verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">un ir kener, leigt tsu dos oier tsu mir.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />vorem dos oier darf pruvn verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">azoi vi der gumen farzucht esen.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />lomir undz oisveiln dos gerechte,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">lomir gevor vern tsvishn undz vos iz gut.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />vorem Iyov zogt: ich bin gerecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">nor El hot opgeton main recht;<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />bai main gerechtikeit ver ich gehaltn far a ligner,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">mesukn iz main vund, on a farbrech.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />voser mentsh vi Iyov</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">trinkt geshpet azoi vi vaser,<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />un firt zich in chavruse mit tuer fun umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">un geit um mit shlechte lait?<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />vorem er zogt: dem mentshn kumt gornisht arois</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">ven er zucht voilgefeln Elokim.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />derum, lait mit farshtandikeit, hert mir tsu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">vait iz El fun umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">un Shaddai fun an avle.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />nor di tuung fun mentshn batsolt er im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">un loit itlechns veg shikt er im tsu.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />yo far vor, El tut nisht kein umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">un Shaddai fardreit nisht gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />ver hot im bafoiln iber der erd?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">un ver hot gemacht di velt in gantsn?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />az er zol kern zain harts oif im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">az er zol zain hoich un zain otem ainzamlen tsu zich,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />volt fargein yetveder laib in einem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">un der mentsh volt tsu shtoib zich umkeren.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />un oib du host farshtandikeit, her dos tsu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">farnem dem kol fun maine verter.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />tsi ken gor a faint fun gerechtikeit hershn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">oder vilstu dem machtikn gerechtn bashuldikn? –<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />ken men zogn tsu a melech nidertrechtiker?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">roshe tsu firshtn? –<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />dem vos shanevet nisht dem ponem fun harn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">un acht nisht oifn raichn mer vi oifn oreman,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">vail dos verk fun zaine hent zainen zei ale.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />in a rege shtarbn zei, in halbe nacht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">lait vern tsetreislt un fargeyen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">un me tut op dem machtikn vi nisht mit der hant.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />vorem zaine oign zainen oif di vegen fun dem mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">un ale zaine trit zet er.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />nishto kein fintsternish un kein toitshotn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">far di tuer fun umrecht zich dortn tsu farborgen.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />vorem er macht nisht dem mentshn a tsait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">tsu kumen far El tsum mishpot.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />er tsebrecht machtike on an oisforshung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">un shtelt oif andere anshtot zei.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />far vor, er ken zeyere meisim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">derum macht er an iberker iber nacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">un zei vern tsedrikt.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />vail zei zainen reshoim, shlogt er zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:26">in an ort vu me zet.<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />derfar vos zei hobn zich opgekert fun im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">un oif ale zaine vegen nisht geacht.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />zei hobn gemacht kumen tsu im dos geshrei fun dem oreman,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">un dos geshrei fun di gedrikte flegt er hern. –<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />ober az er shvaigt, ver ken im bashuldikn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">un farborgt er dem ponem, ver ken im veln zen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">sai bai a folk sai bai a mentshn alts eins. –<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />kedei der zindiker mentsh zol nisht kinign,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">kedei kein shtroichlungen zoln nisht zain faran folk.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />vorem hot er den tsu El gezogt:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">ich hob gelitn, ich vel mer nisht shlechts ton;<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />ich ze nisht, lern du mich;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">oib ich hob geton umrecht, vel ich mer nisht ton?<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />zol er fargeltn azoi vi dir kumt ois:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">oib dir gefelt nisht, to klaib du ois, un nisht ich?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">un vos veistu tsu redn?<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />lait mit farshtandikeit veln mir zogn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">un der kluger man vos vet mir tsuhern:<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />Iyov redt on a zinen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">un zaine reid zainen on seichel.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />ich vintsh Iyov zol eibik gepruvet vern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">far entfern azoi vi zindike lait.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />vorem er leigt noch tsu vidershpenikeit tsu zain chet;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">er patsht zaine hent tsvishn undz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">un mert zaine reid kegen El.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" pubnumber="לה" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />un Elihu hot zich opgerufn un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />rechnstu dos far recht, az du zogst:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">ich bin gerechter fun El?<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />ven du zogst: vos kumt dir arois?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">voser nuts hob ich derfun mer vi fun main zindikn?<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />vel ich dir entfern verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">un daine chaverim mit dir.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />lug tsu di himlen, un ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">un kuk oif di volkens vos zainen hoich iber dir.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />az du zindikst, vos virkstu oif im?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">un zainen fil daine farbrechn, vos tustu im?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />az du bist gerecht, vos gistu im?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">oder vos nemt er fun dain hant?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />a man vi du geit on dain shlechtikeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">un a mentshnkind dain gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />fun vegen di fil roiberaien shrait men,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">me klogt zich vegen dem orem fun di shtarke,<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />un me zogt nisht: vu iz Eloah main Bashefer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">vos git gezangen in der nacht;<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />vos lernt undz mer fun beheimes fun der erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">un macht undz kliger fun foigel fun himel?<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />on shrait men, un er entfert nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">vegen der hoferdikeit fun di reshoim.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />ober falsh iz, az El hert nisht tsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">un Shaddai kukt es nisht on.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />hagam du zogst, du kenst im nisht zen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">iz der mishpot far im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">un darfst harn oif im.<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />un atsund, hot den far gornisht geshtroft zain tsorn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">un veis er nisht voil fun der mutvilikeit?<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />ober Iyov efent mit narishkeit zain moil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">on farshtandikeit mert er verter.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" pubnumber="לו" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />un Elihu hot vaiter gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />vort mir a vaile, un ich vel dir zogn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">vorem faran noch verter vegen Eloah.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />ich vel oifheibn main gedank vait ahin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">un main Bashefer vel ich gebn gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />vorem far vor, nisht falsh zainen maine verter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">oifrichtik in gedanken bin ich tsu dir.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />ze, El iz machtik, ober er faracht keinem nisht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">er iz machtik in koiech fun farshtandikeit.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />er lozt nisht dem roshe blaibn lebn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">un git di orime zeyer recht.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />er nemt nisht arop zaine oign fun dem tsadik;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">un mit mlochim oifn tron zetst er zei oif eibik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">un zei vern derheicht.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />un oib zei zainen geshmidt in keitn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">batsvungen in shtrik fun pain,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />redt er zei ois zeyer tuung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">un zeyere farbrechn ven zei shtarkn zich.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />er antplekt zeyer oier far musar,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">un heist, az zei zoln zich umkeren fun umrecht.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />oib zei hern, un dinen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">endikn zei zeyere teg in guts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">un zeyere yorn in Nachat.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />un oib zei hern nisht, kumen zei um durchn shverd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">un fargeyen on farshtandikeit.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />ober di zindike in hartsn leign on tsorn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">zei shraien nisht tsu im ven er bindt zei.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />in yugnt shtarbt zeyer zel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">un zeyer lebn – vi di shandiungen.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />er ratevet dem gedriktn durch zain gedriktkeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">un antplekt durch der noit zeyer oier.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />un oich dich volt er aroisgetsoign fun der klem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">in derbreiternish vu kein engshaft iz nishto;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">un dos gedek fun dain tish volt ful zain mit fetkeit.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />vail ober bist ful mit der taine fun dem roshe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">halt dich der mishpot un di gerechtikeit.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />far vor, es iz do tsorn, azoi hit zich az du zolst nisht avekgenumen vern mit a shlog,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">vos afile a groise oisleizung vet dich nisht derfun kenen bafraien.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />zol er den shatsn dain raichtum?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">nein, kein shum gold un kein shum koiech.<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />zolst nisht gelustn di nacht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">ven felker vern farshvundn oifn ort.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />hit zich zolst zich nisht kern tsu umrecht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">hagam du volst dos oisderveilt eider pain.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />ze, El iz derhoibn in zain shtarkeit;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">ver iz aza lerer vi er?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />ver hot im bafoiln zain veg?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">un ver ken zogn: du tust an avle?<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />gedenk, az du zolst greisn zain verk</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">vos mentshn hobn bazungen.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />ale mentshnkinder hobn es gezen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">der mentsh kukt es on fun der vaitn.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />ze, El iz grois, un mir farshteyen nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">di tsol fun zaine yorn iz nisht tsu derforshn.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />vorem er tsit op di tropns vaser,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">zei zoln zaien regn fun zain nepel;<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />ven di himlen flisn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">un trifn oif mentshn a sach.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />yo, tsi farshteit men di shpreitungen fun volken,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">di gepilders fun zain getselt?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />ze, er shpreit ois deroif zain licht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">un di vortselen fun yam dekt er tsu.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />vorem dermit mishpot er felker,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">git er shpaiz in shefe.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />er shpreit ois oifn himlvelb dem blits,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">un bafelt im er zol trefn.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />es zogt on vegen im</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">der tsorn, der kaas fun dem shturem.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" pubnumber="לז" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />yo, derfun tsitert main harts,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">un shpringt oif fun zain ort.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />hert, hert di umru fun zain kol,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">un dem brum vos geit arois fun zain moil.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />untern gantsn himel lozt er im loiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">un zain blits iz biz di bregn fun der erd.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />hinter dem brilt a kol;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">er dunert mit dem kol fun zain groiskeit;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">un me ken zei nisht ophaltn, ven zain kol vert gehert.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />El dunert vunderlech mit zain kol,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">er tut groise zachn un mir farshteyen nisht.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />vorem er zogt tsum shnei: fal oif der erd!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">dos glaichn tsum gusregn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">tsum gus fun zaine machtike regns.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />er farchasmet di hant fun yetveder mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">az ale mentshn fun zain bashaf zoln visen.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />un di chaye geit arain in baheltenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">un rut in ire nores.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />fun der kamer kumt der shturem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">un fun tsofn-vintn di kelt.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />fun dem otem fun El git es aiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">un breite vasern vern fest.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />yo, er lodt on mit faichtikeit dem volken,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">er shpreit funander zain blitschmare.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />un dos dreit zich rund arum durch zain kireven</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">kedei zei zoln ton alts vos er bafelt zei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">oifn gezicht fun der erdisher velt;<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />sai er shikt es far a shtrof,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">sai far zain erd, sai far genod.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />farnem dos dozike, Iyov,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">shtei un batracht di vunder fun El.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />veistu vi Eloah leigt es aroif oif zei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">un macht laichtn dem blits fun zain chemare?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />farshteistu dem mishkolet funem volken,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">di vunder fun dem alveisikn?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />vi azoi daine begadim vern heis,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">ven di erd ligt shtil fun dorem-vint?<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />kenstu oisshpreitn di himlen mit im,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">fest vi a gegosener shpigl?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />mach undz visen vos mir zoln zogn tsu im;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">mir veisn kein lad nisht fun vegen der fintsternish.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />darf im dertseilt vern az ich red?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">tsi darf a mentsh im oiszogen, ven es iz farhoiln?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />un okersht hot men nisht gezen a heln shain in himel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">iz a vint ariber, un hot im oisgelaitert.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />fun tsofn kumt a gilderne lichtikeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">a mordiker glants iz arum Eloah.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Shaddai, im kenen mir nisht oisgefinen;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">er iz grois in koiech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">ober recht un fule gerechtikeit</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">krivdet er nisht.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />derum forchtn im di mentshn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">er kukt zich nisht um oif ale klughartsike.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" pubnumber="לח" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />un Hashem hot geentfert Iyovn fun shturem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:1">un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />ver fartunklt dos di kavone</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">mit verter on farshtandikeit?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />gurt akorsht on vi a man daine lendn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">un ich vel dich fregn, un du mach mich visen.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />vu bistu geven ven ich hob gegruntfest di erd;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">zog, oib du veist farshtandikeit.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />ver hot gemacht ire mosn, oib du veist?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">oder ver hot getsoign a mestshnur oif ir?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />oif vos zainen ire gruntmoiern aroifgezetst?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">oder ver hot geleigt ir vinkelshtein?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />ven di morgenshteren hobn in einem gezungen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">un ale zin fun Elokim hobn geshalt.<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />un ver hot fartsamt mit tirn dem yam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">ven er hot oisgebrachn un iz fun tracht arois?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />ven ich hob gemacht dem volken far zain malbesh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">un dem nebl far zain viklshnur,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />un ich hob bashtimt far im main gezets,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">un gemacht riglen un tirn,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />un gezogt: biz aher zolstu kumen un nisht vaiter,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">un do vet men farhaltn dem shtolts fun daine indn?<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />hostu zint dain lebtog bafoiln dem frimorgn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">ongevizen dem baginen zain ort?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />kedei ontsunemen di bregn fun der erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">az di reshoim zoln aropgeshoklt vern fun ir.<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />zi shemerirt azoi vi ziglvaks,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">un es ligt azoi vi a malbesh.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />un fun di reshoim vert farmitn zeyer licht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">un der oifgehoibener orem vert tsebrochn.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />bistu gekumen tsu di kvaln fun yam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">un oifn grunt fun tehom umgegangen?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />zainen dir antplekt gevorn di toiern fun toit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">un hostu di toiern fun toitshotn gezen?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />hostu ibergekukt biz di breitkeitn fun der erd?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">zog, oib du veist dos alts.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />oif voser veg rut dos licht?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">un di fintsternish, vu iz ir ort,<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />az du zolst zi nemen tsu ir gemark,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">un az du zolst farshtein di shtegn tsu ir hoiz?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />du veist dos, vorem du bist dentsmol shoin geven geborn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">un di tsol fun daine teg iz grois!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />bistu gekumen tsu di oitseres fun shnei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">oder hostu di oitseres fun hogel gezen,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />vos ich hob bahaltn far a tsait fun noit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">faran tog fun krig un milchome?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />oif voser veg tseteilt zich dos licht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">tseshpreit zich der mizrech-vint iber der erd?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />ver hot durchgehakt far der fleitsung a grobn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">un a veg faran dunergeviter?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />tsu machn regenen oif a land on a mentshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">a midber on a mutermentshn derin;<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />ontsuzetn a vistkeit un a vistenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">un machn shprotsn an oisvaks fun groz.<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />hot der regn a foter?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">oder ver hot geborn di tropns toi?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />fun vemes boich iz arois der aiz?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">un der frost fun himel, ver hot im geborn?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />azoi vi shtein vern vasern farglivert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">un der ponem fun tehom vert farshtart.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />kenstu bindn di keitn fun zibnshtern,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">oder di shtrik fun orion loiz machn?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />kenstu aroisbrengen di mezlut in zeyer tsait,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">un dem Beor mit zaine kinder aroisfirn?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />veistu di gezetsn fun himel?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">tsi machstu zain geveltikung oif der erd?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />kenstu oifheibn tsum volken dain kol,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">az a shefe fun vaser zol dich badekn?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />kenstu aroisshikn blitsn, zei zoln gein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">un zogn tsu dir: do zainen mir?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />ver hot araingeton in di nirn chochme?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">oder ver hot gegebn dem gaist farshtandikeit?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />ver tseilt iber di volkens mit chochme?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">un di loglen fun himel ver gist ois?<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />ven der shtoib iz tsunoifgegosn vi klump,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">un di grudes zainen tsuzamengebakn.<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />kenstu fangen far der leibinte roib,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">un dem bager fun di yungleibn onfiln,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />ven zei beigen zich in di nores,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">ven zei zitsn in tsudek oif der loier?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />ver greit on dem rob zain shpaiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">ven zaine kinder shraien tsu El,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">ven zei vandern um on esen?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" pubnumber="לט" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />veistu di tsait ven di shteintsign gebern?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">gistu achtung ven di hindins hobn veyen?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />tseilstu di chodeshim ven zei darfn derfiln,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">un veistu di tsait fun zeyer gebern?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />zei knien, zei lozn durchbrechn zeyere kinder,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">zei vorfn arois zeyere geburtn.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />zeyere yunge vern shtark, zei vaksn oifn fraien,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">zei geyen avek, un kern zich nisht um tsu zei.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />ver hot aroisgelozt dem valdeizl frai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">un di bind fun dem vildeizl ver hot loiz gemacht,<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />vos ich hob gemacht dem midber far zain hoiz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">un zaltsik land far zaine voinungen?<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />er lacht fun dem tuml fun shtot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">er hert nisht kein traibers geshreyen.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />di nishterung fun di berg iz zain fiterung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">un itlech groz zucht er noch.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />vet der vizltir veln dir dinen?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">tsi vet er nechtikn bai dain korite?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />kenstu tsubindn dem vizltir mit zain shtrik tsu der bait?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">tsi vet er broneven di toln hinter dir?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />kenstu zich farzichern oif im, vail zain koiech iz grois,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">un iberlozen oif im dain mi?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />kenstu im ontroien, az er vet opbrengen dain zomen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">un ainzamlen di tvue fun dain dresh-shaier?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />der fligel fun shtroisfoigl klapt lustik –</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">tsi iz dos der fleder un feder fun shtorch?<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />far vor, zi lozt iber tsu der erd ire aier,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">un in shtoib lozt zi zei oisbrien.<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />un zi fargest az a fus ken zei tsekvetshn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">un a chaye fun feld ken zei tsetretn.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />zi iz hart tsu ire kinder vi tsu nisht ire;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">umnisht meg zain ir mi, zi iz on angst,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />vorem Eloah hot zi geminert fun chochme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">un ir nisht aingeteilt mit seichel.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />atsund heibt zi di fliglen in der heich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">zi lacht fun ferd un fun zain raiter.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />gistu dem ferd gevure?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">bakleidstu zain haldz mit shturem?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />machstu im shpringen vi a heisherik?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">der hilch fun zain hirzhen iz an eime.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />er grablt in tal, un freit zich mitn koiech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">er geit arois dem vafn antkegen.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />er lacht fun angst, un vert nisht dershrokn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">un er kert nisht tsurik far a shverd.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />lebn im klingt der failbaitl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">der flamiker shpiz un di pike.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />mit raash un rugze shlingt er di erd,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">un ken nisht ainshtein baim kol fun a shoifer.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />vi nor a shoifer, zogt er: aha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">un fun vaitn dershmekt er milchome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">dem duner fun di hoiptlait un di shalung.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />durch dain seichel flit den der shparber,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">shpreit zaine fliglen kein dorem?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />tsi oif dain bafel heibt zich oif der odler,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">un macht zain nest in der heich?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />oif a feldz rut er un vailt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">oif a shpits feldz un a bargfestung.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />fun dortn kukt er ois zain esen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">fun vaitn zeen zaine oign.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />un zaine yunge zupn blut,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">un vu dershlogene dortn iz er.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" pubnumber="מ" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />un Hashem hot geentfert Iyovn, un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />vil zich krign mitn Shaddai der tadler?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">der vos vikucht zich mit Eloah zol es entfern.<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />hot Iyov geentfert Hashem un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />ze, vintsik vos bin ich; vos ken ich dir entfern?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">ich tu aroif main hant oif main moil.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />ein mol hob ich geredt, un vel mer nisht entfern;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">yo, tsvei mol un vel es nisht vider ton.<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />hot Hashem geentfert Iyovn fun shturem un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />gurt akorsht on vi a man daine lendn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">ich vel dich fregn, un du mach mich visen.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />tsi vilstu oich farshtern main mishpot?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">vilstu mich bashuldikn kedei du zolst gerecht zain?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />oder tsi hostu an orem vi HaEl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">un mit a kol vi er kenstu dunern?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />tsir zich akorsht on mit shtolts un hoichkeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">un glants un sheinkeit zolstu onton.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />farshpreit dem geirem fun dain tsorn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">un ze vu a shtoltser un dernider im.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />ze vu a shtoltser un mach im untertenik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">un tsetret di reshoim oif zeyer ort.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />bahalt zei in shtoib in einem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">zeyer ponem fardekn in farborgenish.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />un ich oich vel dir moide zain,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">az dain rechte hant ken dir helfn.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />ze nor dem vaserferd vos ich hob gemacht lebn dir;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">groz vi a rind est er.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />ze nor, zain koiech iz in zaine lendn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">un zain shtarkeit in di fleishfedim fun zain boich.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />er shtelt oif zain ek vi a tsederboim,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">di odern fun zaine dichn zainen vi tsvaign.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />zaine beiner zainen rern fun kuper,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">zaine knochns vi aizerne shtangen.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />er iz di Peor fun derchi־el,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">bloiz zain Bashefer ken brengen zain shverd.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />vorem futer trogn im di berg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">vos ale chayes fun feld shpiln zich dortn.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />unter lotusbeimer ligt er,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">in farborgenish fun ror un zump.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />lotusbeimer bashiremen im mit zeyer shotn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">im ringlen arum verbes fun taich.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />ze, der taich fleitst ariber, un er ailt zich nisht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">er iz zicher, ven a Yarden shpart zich in zain moil.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />ken men far zaine oign im chapn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">mit pastkes durchlechern di noz?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" altnumber="41:1" sid="JOB 40:25" /> kenstu aroistsien dem lioiotn mit a vende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:25">un mit a shtrik aropshlepn zain tsung?<verse eid="JOB 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" altnumber="41:2" sid="JOB 40:26" /> kenstu arainton a ror in zain noz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:26">oder mit a dorn durchboiern zain kinbak?<verse eid="JOB 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" altnumber="41:3" sid="JOB 40:27" /> vet er zich fil betn bai dir?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:27">tsi vet er redn tsu dir veich?<verse eid="JOB 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" altnumber="41:4" sid="JOB 40:28" /> vet er shlisn a bris mit dir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:28">zolst im nemen far an eibikn knecht?<verse eid="JOB 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" altnumber="41:5" sid="JOB 40:29" /> kenstu zich shpiln mit im vi mit a foigel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:29">un im tsubindn far daine meidlech?<verse eid="JOB 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" altnumber="41:6" sid="JOB 40:30" /> veln zich dingen shutfim iber im?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:30">veln zei im tseteiln tsvishn di hendler?<verse eid="JOB 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" altnumber="41:7" sid="JOB 40:31" /> kenstu onfiln mit shtechers zain fel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:31">un mit fishhokn zain kop?<verse eid="JOB 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" altnumber="41:8" sid="JOB 40:32" /> tu aroif oif im dain hant!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:32">dermon zich di milchome, vestu es mer nisht ton.<verse eid="JOB 40:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" pubnumber="מא" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" altnumber="41:9" sid="JOB 41:1" /> ze, di hofenung vert tsum narn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">shoin fun zain onblik vert men doch anidergeshlaidert.<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" altnumber="41:10" sid="JOB 41:2" /> nishto der achzer oif zich vos zol im veln oifreitsn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">haint ver iz der vos ken zich shteln far mir?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" altnumber="41:11" sid="JOB 41:3" /> ver es tret arois akegn mir, dem batsol ich;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">vos untern gantsn himel iz main.<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" altnumber="12" sid="JOB 41:4" /> zol ich im farshvaign zaine ploideraien,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">un dos hoferdike redn, un zain sheinem maineloshn?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" altnumber="13" sid="JOB 41:5" /> ver hot opgedekt zain oisnveinikst malbesh?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">tsu zain topeln gebis ver ken tsukumen?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" altnumber="14" sid="JOB 41:6" /> di tirn fun zain ponem ver hot geefent?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">arum zaine tsein iz an eime.<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" altnumber="15" sid="JOB 41:7" /> shtolts zainen di pantsershupn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">tsunoifgeshlosn vi mit a zigl a festn;<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" altnumber="16" sid="JOB 41:8" /> eine tsu der anderer zainen zei nont,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">az a luft ken nisht durchgein tsvishn zei.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" altnumber="17" sid="JOB 41:9" /> eine tsu der tsveiter iz baheft,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">zei haltn zich fest un tsesheidn zich nisht.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" altnumber="18" sid="JOB 41:10" /> zain nisn shtralt arois a licht,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">un zaine oign zainen vi di bremen fun frimorgn.<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" altnumber="19" sid="JOB 41:11" /> fun zain moil geyen flamen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">funken faier raisn zich arois.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" altnumber="20" sid="JOB 41:12" /> fun zaine nozlecher geit a roich,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">vi fun a kochikn top un brenedikn ror.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" altnumber="21" sid="JOB 41:13" /> zain otem glit vi koiln,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">un a flaker geit arois fun zain moil.<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" altnumber="22" sid="JOB 41:14" /> oif zain haldz rut di shtarkeit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">un im farois tantst di angst.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" altnumber="23" sid="JOB 41:15" /> di kneitshn fun zain fleish zainen baheft;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">es iz fest oif im, es rirt zich nisht.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" altnumber="24" sid="JOB 41:16" /> zain harts iz fest vi shtein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">yo, fest vi an untershter milshtein.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" altnumber="25" sid="JOB 41:17" /> far zain heib shrekn zich di machtike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">fun tsebrochnkeit vern zei oiser zich.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" altnumber="26" sid="JOB 41:18" /> vil men im onkrign, ken kein shverd nisht bashtein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">kein shpiz, kein varfshpiz, un kein fail.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" altnumber="27" sid="JOB 41:19" /> er batracht aizn far shtroi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">un kuper far holts farfoiltn.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" altnumber="28" sid="JOB 41:20" /> im faryogt nisht der zun fun boign;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">farkert in shprei vern far im shlaider-shteiner.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" altnumber="29" sid="JOB 41:21" /> vi shprei zainen fleker gerechnt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">un er lacht fun raash fun der pike.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" altnumber="30" sid="JOB 41:22" /> zain unterzait iz shpitsike sharbns;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">er bet ois a dreshshlitn oifn koit.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" altnumber="31" sid="JOB 41:23" /> er tsekocht vi a top di tifenish,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">er macht dem yam vi zud.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" altnumber="32" sid="JOB 41:24" /> hinter zich lozt er a lichtikn shteg;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">me meint der tehom iz graizgro.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" altnumber="33" sid="JOB 41:25" /> nishto oif der erd zain glaichn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">gemacht tsu zain on a moire.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" altnumber="34" sid="JOB 41:26" /> oif yetveder hechstn kukt er arop,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">er iz der melech iber ale shtoltse chayes.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" pubnumber="מב" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />hot Iyov geentfert Hashem un hot gezogt:<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />ich veis az alts kenstu ton,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">un kein trachtung iz nisht farmitn fun dir.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />ver ken dos farhoiln di kavone on farshtandikeit?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">derum zog ich az ich farshtei nisht;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">vunder zainen dos far mir, un ich veis nisht.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />her, ich bet dich, un ich vel redn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">ich vel dich fregn, un du mach mich visen.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />mit geher fun oier hob ich fun dir gehert,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">un atsund hot main oig dich gezen.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />derum faracht ich maine reid</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">un hob charote, in shtoib un ash.<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />un es iz geven noch dem vi Hashem hot geredt di dozike verter tsu Iyovn, hot Hashem gezogt tsu Elifaz dem Temani: main tsorn grimt oif dir un oif daine tsvei gute fraint, far vos ir hot nisht geredt vegen mir azoi oifrichtik vi main knecht Iyov. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />un atsund nemt aich zibn oksen un zibn viders, un geit tsu main knecht Iyovn, un ir zolt oifbrengen a brandopfer far aich, un Iyov main knecht vet mispalel zain far aich, vorem bloiz zain ponem vel ich oifnemen, aich nisht ontsuton kein shand, vail ir hot nisht geredt vegen mir azoi oifrichtik vi main knecht Iyov.<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />iz Elifaz der Temani, un Bildad der Shuchi, un Tsofar der Naamati, gegangen, un zei hobn geton azoi vi Hashem hot tsu zei geredt; un Hashem hot geshoint Iyovs ponem.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />un Hashem hot umkert Iyovs gefangenshaft, az er hot mispalel geven far zaine gute fraint; un Hashem hot gemert alts vos Iyov hot gehat topl. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />un ale zaine brider, un ale zaine shvester, un ale zaine bakente fun frier, zainen gekumen tsu im, un hobn gegesn mit im broit in zain hoiz, un zei hobn im badoyert, un im getreist oif al dem beiz vos Hashem hot oif im gebracht; un zei hobn im gegebn itlecher a ksith, un itlecher a gildernem nozring.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />un Hashem hot gebentsht Iyovs letst mer vi zain onheib, un er hot gehat fertsn toiznt shof, un zeks toiznt kemlen, un toiznt geshpan rinder, un toiznt eizelins. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />un er hot gehat zibn zin un drai techter. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />un er hot gerufn dem nomen fun einer Yemimah, un dem nomen fun der tsveiter Ketsiah, un dem nomen fun der driter Keren-Hapuch. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />un in gantsn land hobn zich nisht gefunen azelche sheine froien vi Iyovs techter. un zeyer foter hot zei gegebn a nachle tsvishn zeyere brider.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />un Iyov hot gelebt noch dem hundert un fertsik yor; un er hot gezen zaine kinder un zaine kinds-kinder, fir doires. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />un Iyov iz geshtorbn alt un zat mit teg.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>